(38, 68, 492, 1, NULL, '2005-06-30', '2005-08-29', '2006-07-23', '6', '2203', '0', '13500000', '175', '60000', 'Laundered Linen', '23000000', '8', '785', '75', '18500', '115', '910', '125', 'Got me thinking\\\\\\\' very helpful. We attacked almost everything you suggested. Sometimes with a different approach. Dropped our gas use by 15% and our water use by 25%. National information is available to compare them to other laundry\\\\\\\'s in terms of water and energy efficiency. They used to be in the best (75%?) quartile. Now they are among the 5% best.', 'Recommended the service to a friend with a linen mill in Georgia (they used Gerorgia Tech?', '', '105070', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
