(40, 70, 494, 1, NULL, '2005-08-23', '2005-12-13', '2006-08-25', '10', '2083', '311213', '33000000', '21', '350000', 'Malted Barley', '110000000', '8760', '9115', '50', '100000', '225', '514', '120', 'Executive summary was his favorite page. Sees it as his marching orders. \n \n On the down side they saw a huge loss of business a month or two after we left. Lost their main client. Now they are malting for smaller brewers. It has been a tough year - they are down to 6 or 7 employees.', 'Did not just shorten the time using the Vortec coolers. He Turned off every one in the plant to no ill effect.', '', '250000', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
