(53, 83, 507, 1, NULL, '2006-06-30', '2006-10-06', '2007-11-26', '8', '2023', '311514', '120000000', '42', '40000', 'Dairy', '292000000', '8760', '773', '250', '', '', '', '', 'Real helpful to have new eyes in the plant. Made us think differently. The time was well spent.', 'Got them going on energy projects. Also worked with BPA to install a new VSD on the butter churn.', NULL, '130300', 0, '0000-00-00', NULL, ''),
(54, 84, 508, 1, NULL, '2006-08-08', '2006-12-20', '2007-08-20', '6', '2034', '311423', '84000000', '60', '200000', 'Frozen Fried Potatoes', '140000', '6289', '150', '150', '', '', '670', '108', 'Very appreciative of the effort. Very helpful report. Woud have done even more, but Corporate is reluctant to make big investments as they are considering selling the plant.', '', '', '158600', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(55, 85, 509, 1, NULL, '2006-08-09', '2007-02-08', '2007-08-23', '6', '3365', '331524', '14500000', '90', '85000', 'Aluminum Castings', '2584000', '7752', '1193', '150', '0', '0', '1562', '115', 'What a great report.  We looked at what we can do in-house, within our expenditure limits, then I sent the whole thing, lock, stock, to the PUD.  The PUD just changed their mandate on energy efficiency projects, so this was the perfect time to get your report.  We\\\'re working with Jim White to determine which recommendations they will support.\\\'\n \n \\\'There\\\'s no question about it, you did a great job.  Anytime you want to come back up here, you\\\'re always welcome.\\\'\n \n Great Experience. Would invite you back in a moment. You focused on energy users we might never have thought to look at.', '', '', '85960', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(56, 86, 510, 1, NULL, '2006-08-10', '2006-12-29', '2007-08-24', '', '2033', '311421', '50000000', '100', '430000', 'canned corn', '96000000', '9', '1385', '200', '', '', '', '110', 'Sorry that we have not implemented as many projects as you may have liked.   We do appreciate the time that you took to come and evaluate our operation.  \n \n I was new on board at this location. This gave me a chance to get into the guts of this plant.', 'While working on capturing the cooker cooling water flow (in lieu of the condensate) we decided to go after an economizer for the boiler too. Savings of $15k a year at a cost of $50K.', '', '96500', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(57, 87, 511, 1, NULL, '2006-08-30', '2007-02-14', '2008-10-24', '6', '2051', '311812', '45000000', '275', '150000', 'bread, buns', '25000', '7488', '674', '100', '', '', '', '125', 'The report helped us to make some pretty big gains', '', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(58, 88, 512, 1, NULL, '2006-09-01', '2007-01-03', '2007-08-22', '7', '3728', '336413', '78000000', '340', '380000', 'Air Craft Flooring, Air Craft Air Ducting', '630000', '4000', '', '', '', '', '', '110', 'We have undergone some reorganization since your visit. I was brought in as a temporary Facilities Manager in February to free Tom up to work QA issues associated with the 787 project. I had to track down some information to answer your questions', '', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(59, 89, 513, 1, NULL, '2006-09-01', '2006-12-19', '2008-10-16', '7', '3565', '333993', '36000000', '180', '110000', 'Packaging equipment', '315', '4368', '295', '75', '', '', '', '110', 'Report was thorough and helpful. But, things really changed here since you visited. We decided to outsource all of our fabrication to local shops often selling them our equipment and placing our our employees there) so we would not be so subject to the seasonal swing of our sales. Those folks can do other work at the shops in our off season. We only kept a few pieces of equipment for re-work requirments. Our main work on site now is assembling the parts and managing the outsourced fabrication.', '', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(60, 90, 514, 1, NULL, '2006-10-27', '2006-12-27', '2008-09-24', '', '2761', '322221', '81794000', '215', '228600', 'Printed paper', '200000', '8700', '', '', '293', '100', '', '125', 'I am sad to report that we have not done much with this report for a few reasons.\n We are using the advice to improve efficiencies in specific areas as we go.  1.1 year payback does not fly with our corporate capital approval.\n \n Second, our capital money restrictions and own \\\'beliefs\\\' prevented most of these projects from happening:\n \n I believe the report was very well put together and presented.  The findings were sound.  We have and will continue to use the recommendations in our day-to-day repair work (lights, airlines, etc) as it makes sense. \n \n  \n \n I have found I am un-able to show accurate implementation costs or show savings on much of this.  My accounting system does not break this out.  I have work orders that can tell me the cost to re-lamp an area and can count the bulbs and calculate \\\'savings\\\' but I have not done this.', '', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(61, 91, 515, 1, '', '2006-12-08', '2007-03-14', '2008-10-16', '7', '2084', '312130', '14000000', '160', '113000', 'Wine', '400', '3744', '', '', '', '', '215', '120', 'Report was very usefull. Also putting in solar panel farm on fallow property.', 'Comments to be entered by interviewer only !', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(62, 92, 516, 1, NULL, '2007-02-06', '2007-04-27', '2008-10-20', '5', '2439', '321214', '50000000', '100', '115000', 'trusses', '70000000', '2600', '1770', '250', '', '', '', '110', 'Report was very helpful. It provided all the information we needed to file for capital projects with corporate. Very in depth, almost more than needed. \n \n On the difficult side, the current buisness environment has forced them to close the truss plant part of their operation.', 'Put in efficient lighting in both plants.', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(63, 93, 517, 2, NULL, '2007-03-29', '2007-06-25', '2008-10-22', '', '2992', '324191', '87000000', '24', '51500', 'Oil Lubricant', '19500', '2080', '', '', '', '', '', '110', 'Report was \\\'extremely useful\\\'. We would like to do it again some time.\n \n Plant split into two groups, Process & commited staff and investment in a biofuel project, Energy efficiency projects there have taken a back seat.', 'Put in VSD compressor', '', '12000', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(64, 94, 518, 1, NULL, '2007-05-24', '2007-07-24', '2008-10-20', '5', '2026', '424430', '53000000', '199', '70000', 'milk', '15600', '8', '4600', '', '', '', '', '110', 'Maintenance crew has been overloaded with project to expand capcity (new equipment and silos)  in response to new business from a closed dairy up-state.  Great to have you come and recognize how much we had already done.', 'Installed dock door seals and strip curtains on freezers.', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(65, 95, 519, 1, NULL, '2007-06-26', '2007-08-26', '2008-10-29', '5', '2436', '321211', '136000000', '409', '560000', 'Plywood', '400000000', '8760', '11459', '500', '', '', '', '110', 'Very positive process. Appreciated the detail of the analysis that let us review assumptions and revise per our own judgment.', '', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(66, 96, 520, 1, NULL, '2007-06-27', '2007-10-19', '2008-10-21', '6', '2064', '311330', '5000000', '500', '50000', 'fruit and candy', '500000', '5000', '500', '75', '10000', '50', '', '90', 'Very helpful to get this kind of input. Working on carbon footprint accounting. Report of some use there.', 'Replaced CRTs with Flat screens. Replaced even more lighting than we suggested. Put in new compressed air system that is much more efficient.', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(67, 97, 521, 1, NULL, '2007-05-10', '2007-12-07', '2008-10-20', '6', '2493', '321212', '86000000', '305', '700000', 'plywood', '600000000', '8760', '4727', '350', '', '', '', '110', 'The report was very helpful,  thorough and asy to understand. Whether looking for an overall summary or detailed analysis of a particular project. Very impressive, considering, the number of items covered and considered. Thank you for the individual AR Excel spread sheets. This makes adjusting, payback, usage, etc. very easy, when operating, parameters change.   I did not realize the extent and depth, that the assessment would entail, or knowledge that the analyst?s would bring. I was elated with the overall project and your team?s enthusiasm.', 'We are currently installing T5 ho fixtures with motion sensors in numerous locations. Also evaluating multiple hydraulic systems, with potential VFD?s, or cycling and staging pumps according to required load.', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(68, 98, 522, 2, NULL, '2007-08-21', '2007-12-04', '2008-10-20', '5', '3411', '332431', '53000000', '208', '40600', 'Metal Containers', '520000', '8', '160', '40', '', '', '', '110', 'Matt McCoy no longer there. Was referred to Paul Troiano (971-563-3012) Hew was unsure what was done by Matt. He had me send the report and so he could look it over and try to get back to me.', '', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
