(73, 103, 527, 1, NULL, '2007-10-10', '2008-02-28', '2008-10-03', '', '3231', '332321', '60000000', '217', '120000', 'Window Fixtures', '200000', '5780', '250', '75', '0', '0', '', '110', 'I appreciate the visit to our plant. Your team opened our eyes to seeing cost savings in locations we did not anticipate but knew were there. The air leaks is a good example. After seeing the cost, the need to fix was apparent. Also, the assessment helped me to see the value in upgrading our lighting system and talking to vendors about improving our lighting while reducing our environmental impact.', 'Comments to be entered by interviewer only !', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
