(76, 106, 530, 1, NULL, '2008-04-04', '2008-07-10', '2009-07-20', '7', '2493', '321219', '100000000', '320', '325930', 'Particle Board', '177650000', '2920', '750', '40', '', '', '250', '100', 'Positive experience, worth our time. Wish we could act on more. Awsome report - wish we had the money to do everything.', '', NULL, '69600', 0, '0000-00-00', NULL, ''),
(77, 107, 531, 1, NULL, '2008-04-10', '2008-07-30', '2009-07-01', '7', '3221', '327213', '10000000', '68', '74000', 'LED Substrates and Laser Crystals', '1000', '8760', '5000', '500', '0', '', '125', '100', 'Very appreciative of the report. I did enjoy it. The bad news is St.Gobain announced plans to close the Washougal plant last week. Its last days will be in August.', 'The pie chart was of particular use. Helped us see where we needed to focus. We did not realize how much energy cost was tied up in the Annealing process. The are working on an R&D process to eliminate that step. Suspect it is not needed.', '', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(78, 108, 532, 1, '', '2008-06-19', '2008-09-03', '2009-08-03', '12', '2821', '325211', '84000000', '92', '217800', 'Urea-Formaldehyde', '120000000', '8760', '2110', '', '', '', '200', '', 'It all comes back to the money and manpower that this company does not have. Although the ideas were well thought out and could save Arclin money over time, none of them were implemented. Since the report was issued, the Springfield plant has lost approximately 35% of its employees including maintenance personnel. This is mainly due to the downturn in the construction industry which has greatly affected our volumes. We are currently running on a make-to-order basis and have shut down one production day per week.\n  \n As for the report, it was very easy to read and I believe it was helpful. The suggestions were valuable but again, due to lack of time and money, they were not implemented. Your visit helped make people more aware of the lighting issues around the plant and the need to turn off equipment that is not needed. I have referenced your report several times when talking with our engineers about possible future projects.', 'Comments to be entered by interviewer only !', '', '0', 0, '2012-12-01', '', ''),
(79, 109, 533, 1, '', '2008-07-02', '2009-06-29', '2009-07-20', '6', '2431', '321911', '16687824', '115', '200000', 'Doors', '8897', '2080', '481', '', '', '', '125', '', 'I know it seems like we?re dragging our feet on some of this stuff, but please understand your service is very valuable and we will eventually implement all the recommendations.', '', '', '42837', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
