(141, 204, 626, 1, NULL, '2011-06-28', '2011-08-28', '2013-07-28', '7', '2435', '321211', '53406160', '200', '328548', 'Hardwood Plywood', '2920000', '4000', '6210', '800', '215', '', '', '', 'The financial condition we were operating under did not allow... (payback over a year).\n\nThe report was put together well, however there is typically underlining factors that may or may not arise during an initial survey that can effect payback.  Sometimes text book evaluations and comparisons become skewed in a realistic setting usually because it may contain many more factors that need to taken into consideration.  I appreciate the hard work that went into the analysis and report and I hold on to the information for upcoming projects and/or modifications to our plants.\n\n\nThanks again for all the hard work and effort that went into the assessment. \n ', '', '', '', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(142, 206, 617, 1, '', '2011-06-30', '2011-08-29', '2013-12-12', '7', '5031', '423310', '35000000', '185', '510000', 'Millwork', '240000000', '6240', '', '300', '21135', '100', '400', '120', 'Hard to get anything approved with this housing market. There were other items submitted to management but nothing was approved at that time.  Nothing more has been done to date. ', '', '', '', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(143, 205, 616, 0, NULL, '2011-06-30', '2011-08-30', '2013-07-19', '7', '2493', '321999', '27000000', '64', '98700', 'Fiber Door Skins', '6365000', '8760', '9500', '2000', '1704', '210', '400', '120', 'I feel the report was helpful in that energy saving within the plant was looked at from an outside point of view.\n\nIt was easy to read and follow the line of thought of the writer(s).', '', NULL, '', 0, '0000-00-00', NULL, ''),
(145, 207, 618, 1, NULL, '2011-07-05', '2011-08-31', '2012-06-18', '4', '0273', '112512', '650000', '6', '20000', 'Shellfish Larvae', '6000000000', '6720', '200', '75', '0', '125', '0', '0', 'Thanks for assessment. It helped us get better focus on our energy costs. Our product demand had been in boom so it has been hard to follow up on recommendations. So far have only gone after improved boiler efficiency.', '', '', '72000', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
