(594, 1, 425, 1, NULL, '2002-09-17', '2002-12-21', '2004-08-04', '7', '2493', '321219', '40000000', '150', '0', 'MDF', '1000000', '7200', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Very helpful report. However, market collapsed significantly after our visit. Curtailed one shift, layed off personell, quit spending money. Constrained their investment.', 'Our involvment inspired whole team to look closely at other energy issues at plant. Did some other projects: VFD on a 250 HP fan to drop to ~35% speed for ~80% of time. T5 lighting in offices and warehouse, Instrumented Hog to turn off automatically when not in use (30% of time, <1yr PB.', '', '124395', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
