(607, 14, 438, 1, NULL, '2003-06-19', '2003-08-22', '2004-07-06', '6', '3273', '327320', '50000000', '300', '0', 'Pre-mixed  Concrete', '15600', '2600', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Useful report - took info and did what they could. Played into developing in-house energy focus. Report helped ingnite effort to tune boilers a 10 different plants in the area.', 'VFD Kiln recommendation influenced purchase of second kiln. Made sure to include VFD option in it.', '', '9092', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
