(611, 18, 442, 2, NULL, '2003-06-27', '2003-09-02', '2004-07-08', '6', '2022', '311513', '65000000', '60', '85000', 'Cheese', '42536000', '5616', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Plan major expansion beginning Feb 2005 for 14 months.  Many changes planned then.  Thought IAC is good program and would like our analysis of new plant, either plans or after.', 'OMC#1=Set back thermostat.  Plan to implement.  OMC#2=land apply waste water', '', '14953', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(612, 19, 443, 1, NULL, '2003-08-10', '2003-09-22', '2004-08-30', '5', '2421', '321912', '14000000', '60', '15000', 'Green Douglas Fir Dimensional Lumber', '33397', '4080', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Great Report- very usefull. Implemented near term items. Using longer term ARs in new plant.', 'Also got them thinking about compressed air system. They had to separate systems separated by distance. Used Energy Trust money to bore an underground hole an lay line to connect the two systems. Also converted hydraulic drives to vsd control. More efficient and turn off when not needed.', '', '610311', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(613, 20, 444, 1, NULL, '2003-08-11', '2003-09-17', '2004-08-30', '5', '2412', '321918', '10000000', '48', '0', 'Old Growth Dimensional Lumber', '7500', '2375', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Very helpful report. Provided great impetus to move forward on new projects.', 'Implemented \\\'Other Measures Considered\\\' including light occupancy sensors & hanger skylights.', '', '940340', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(614, 21, 445, 2, NULL, '2003-09-10', '2003-10-25', '2004-06-10', '6', '1442', '212321', '17300000', '14', '3840', 'Asphalt, Aggregate, STB', '825000', '2020', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', 'OMC#1: Reduce Asphalt compressor air leaks.  OME#2:  Add air receiver capacity.  OMC#3: reduce air pressure 10 psig, save $300/yr.  OMC#4: Replace diesel pump with electric pump, save $2,000/hr.  OMC#5: VFD on baghouse fan (2 150 hp motors) save $2,400/yr', '', '126288', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(615, 22, 446, 2, NULL, '2003-08-25', '2003-11-22', '2004-06-25', '5', '2431', '321911', '50000000', '260', '0', 'Door Frame Parts', '27100000', '4590', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', 'OMC#1:Save $11,300/yr with radial tip fan blade, but > 5-year PB.  Consider when blades need replacing.  OMC#2: Recover dryer heat, but too low temp.', '', '31998', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(616, 23, 447, 2, NULL, '2003-08-26', '2003-11-23', '2004-07-07', '5', '2436', '321212', '27500000', '175', '0', 'plywood', '108000000', '6240', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Bought another plant in Rogue River, so lots of new projects now.', 'OMC#1:Service desiccant air dryer.  Has capacity but does not dry well.  OMC#2: Radial-tip fan save $4,200/yr ~5 yr PB.  OMC#3: Consider using newer CB boiler as lead.  OMC#4:  Repair air leaks.  Plant doesn\\\'t shut down to measure.  OMC#5.  Consider low-unload controls on air compressor', '', '157120', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(617, 24, 448, 1, NULL, '2003-09-17', '2003-11-28', '2005-08-19', '6', '3732', '336612', '63260000', '300', '0', 'Fiberglass Boats', '1612', '4080', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'You folks clearly put in a lot of work to prepare this report.', 'They decided to purchase new, more efficienct air compressors. \n \n They are also installing a new vacuum system.  It will have waste gates (baghouse) for sawdust collection.  This is a new energy-efficient system. We mentioned this in the \\\\\\\'Other Measures Considered\\\\\\\' section of the report.', '', '8400', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(618, 25, 449, 2, NULL, '2003-09-17', '2003-12-30', '2005-06-16', '6', '2452', '321992', '23000000', '155', '120000', 'Manufactured Homes', '1018', '2000', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '', '', '8013', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(619, 26, 450, 1, NULL, '2003-09-25', '2003-12-02', '2005-08-11', '4', '2491', '321114', '4800000', '25', '40000', 'Treated Wood', '4000000', '8592', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'The report was very useful. We had performed an internal assessment but yours was much more thorough.', '', '', '31134', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(620, 27, 451, 1, NULL, '2003-10-07', '2003-12-05', '2005-08-01', '4', '3272', '32739', '11000000', '90', '0', 'Precast Concrete', '14094486', '2080', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Very helpful\\\'', '', '', '3793', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(621, 28, 452, 1, NULL, '2003-11-20', '2004-02-02', '2005-08-26', '4', '2653', '322211', '43500000', '130', '516478', 'Corrugated Cardboard', '869000000', '6600', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Enjoyed and appreciated the report. They have limited money and time to perform this type of analysis, and it is good to get information and feedback from someone other than vendors. Corporate is pushing them to become more efficient but at the same time not offering as much in the way of engineering services.', 'They respun an number of our recommendations to meet their own criteria better. On compressed air the have been working on phasing out use of compressed air that can be replaced with less energy intensive alternatives. They are also now looking at installing T8s.', '', '116967', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(622, 29, 453, 1, NULL, '2003-10-07', '2004-02-27', '2005-08-26', '6', '2436', '321212', '80000000', '340', '', 'Plywood', '267000', '7300', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'The report was excellent. Easy to read. They keep it on hand and still use as referece .', 'Instead of turning off some of their Mercury Vapor lamps in the fineshed products storage. They instead replaced them with T8s and motion sensors. The local utility picked up the entire bill, they got a $5,000 tax break from the state, and estimate they are saving $8,000 a year.', '', '38660', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(623, 30, 454, 2, NULL, '2004-01-19', '2004-04-02', '2005-06-30', '4', '3429', '33251', '6000000', '25', '', 'Gun Swivels', '7600000', '1912', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Very helpful.  Great benefit.', 'They included lean manufacturing principles in the dedicated swivel line, and continue to improve all areas of production.', '', '66900', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(624, 203, 615, 1, '', '2011-05-24', '2011-08-31', '2013-07-17', '5', '2491', '321114', '45000000', '40', '28000', 'Utility Poles', '1000', '8760', '1', '300', '12', '150', '0', '135', 'Purchased by Stella Jones - cost cutting program leading up to sale precluded much investment. ', 'Put in VFDs per our report comments. Flash steam recommendation drew their attention to the fact that traps had failed and got improved efficiency correcting that. ', '', '', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(625, 202, 614, 2, NULL, '2011-04-29', '2011-08-13', '2013-10-08', '6', '2421', '321113', '15600000', '57', '34380', 'Lumber', '40000000', '3340', '3', '400', '0', '0', '0', '110', 'Little overwhelming at first because of a lot of information, but very helpful in the end. Easy to read if you were familiar with the lingo.', 'Would like us to visit their other facilities in Forest Grove/Gaston, Tillamook, and Idaho. Contact Spencer Hull as well as Dathan as they are heading up the inter facility coordination.', '', '16000', 0, '0000-00-00', 'They are currently redoing the service entrance wiring from the transformers into the mill to fix a 20 volt voltage drop, hopefully solving low power factor issues. The edger infeed rollers are now on only as needed since they installed a VFD on the motor. Purchased a new forklift with a more efficient diesel engine to optimize fuel use, they will be ordering another one.', ''),
(627, 655, 633, 1, NULL, '2012-01-25', '2012-04-19', '2013-10-07', '4', '7389', '561910', '5482887', '120', '100000', 'Packages', '', '2690', '', '', '', '', '20', '', 'Report contained lots of helpful information and Paul Spaniol looked into implementing the recommendations after receiving the report.  However, Paul no longer works with DePaul and neither does the maintenance manager who was in charge at the time.  The Operations Manager, Linda Weaklem, updated me on the recommendations to the best of her knowledge.', 'None.', NULL, '438', 0, '0000-00-00', 'None.', ''),
