(635, 211, 622, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '0000-00-00', NULL, ''),
(637, 664, 639, 1, NULL, '2012-03-27', '2012-07-09', '2013-10-18', '6', '2436', '321212', '30000000', '60', '86000', 'Veneer', '', '5616', '5000', '500', '25000', '150', '350', '100', 'Unfortunately, we have not implemented any of the recommendations. I am currently in the process of reviewing the reports to decide if it would be feasible for us to move forward on the recommendations.  The reports have been easy to read and understand. If the outcomes of the recommendations are positive, we will implement them to the rest of our plants in the Western Oregon Region. I apologize for the late feedback and lack of information. Please check back with me at a later date. If there are any other questions please let me know.', '', '', '', 0, '2014-04-20', '', ''),
(638, 663, 190, 1, '', '2012-03-29', '2012-07-13', '2013-08-05', '11', '2026', '311511', '26000000', '30', '30169', ' Milk', '--', '8760', '800', '100', '40000', '90', '80', '120', 'Report one part of critical mass that is leading to a lot of energy actions at the plant and throughout the company. ', '2.5 Looking at getting a newer more efficient hot water heater instead  of boiler - perhaps condensing hot water heater - also newer ammonia compressors. Overall engine room overhaul. OMCs were instructive: Were able to turn half of the evaporator fans off.  More aggressive on air leaks now - one filler you noted was blowing air night and day whether filling or not was corrected. Cleaned the condensers got lower approach temperatures.  Were able to reduce discharge pressure. Added VFDs to compressors and evaporator fans. Been working on the boiler in general. Overall engine room overhaul including boilers and newer ammonia compressors. ', '', '', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(639, 144, 545, 1, '', '2011-02-08', '2011-04-22', '0000-00-00', '8', '2421', '321113', '75513000', '199', '322438', 'Lumber', '400000000', '8760', '1990', '', '', '', '', '', 'Jim Cook not there - not sure who would be the right person. She will try to find out and get back in acouple of days. (Knows the report) - Juliana Ruble - Called Neal on 10/7 to find out if he would have answers or if there was someone else to contact. Left another message on 10/18/13.', '', '', '', 1, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(640, 227, 629, 2, NULL, '2011-12-14', '0000-00-00', '0000-00-00', '4', '0181', '111421', '', '250', '', 'Plants', '', '2860', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
(641, 654, 632, 1, '', '2012-01-17', '2012-05-10', '2013-09-03', '5', '4911', '221112', '70000000 ', '20', '30000', 'Electricity', '1500000000', '6000 ', '7200', '1400', '610000', '1650', '250', '125', 'This assessment has been very helpful to the RRGP team.  The report was easy to read and captured a lot of accurate operational information.  The OSU team was very professional, courteous and quite detective like in their on-site behaviors.  It was a pleasure to hear new ideas and have an actual evaluation completed, rather than the typical ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â¦ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…â€œthis may help reduce costsÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â (with no supporting data.)  The OSU team asked all the right questions to make the audit experience beneficial to us.  We all enjoyed the creative and collaborative approach that the team used to complete this evaluation project. Thank you for taking the time to complete the evaluation and for all of the recommendations.  It has been a pleasure working with you.', '1.1 In addition, having your team on-site has helped the plant team to be more aware of other ways to conserve and make the plant more efficient.   The lighting retrofit opened our eyes to new technology that can save big dollars and improve lighting levels as well as the quality of light throughout the plantÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¾Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢s working spaces.\n\nAlso, the combustion turbine compressor bleed system that was our on-line source was decommissioned improving the turbine compressor efficiency.', '', '71207', 0, '2014-08-01', '', ''),
(642, 665, 642, 1, '', '2012-03-28', '2012-07-27', '2013-10-18', '8', '2439', '321213', '100000000 / day', '110', '275000', 'I joists', 'n/a', 'm-f 2 shifts', '5000', '300', 'n/a', '300', '500', '101', 'Unfortunately, we have not implemented any of the recommendations. I am currently in the process of reviewing the reports to decide if it would be feasible for us to move forward on the recommendations.  The reports have been easy to read and understand. If the outcomes of the recommendations are positive, we will implement them to the rest of our plants in the Western Oregon Region. I apologize for the late feedback and lack of information. Please check back with me at a later date. If there are any other questions please let me know.', '', NULL, '', 0, '2014-04-20', '', ''),
(643, 134, 225, 1, '', '2010-06-18', '2010-08-16', '2011-09-12', '7', '2037', '311411', '200000000', '150', '378448', 'Bean, Corn and Squash', '150000000 lbs', '4271', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Good to have you here. Makes you ask questsions and look at things differently.', '', '', '', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
