(767, 806, 867, 4, '', '2015-08-26', '0000-00-00', '2016-07-21', '6', '2421', '321999', 'N/A', '20', '435600', 'Crossarms', '15000000 bd. ft.', '6552', '725', '', '', '', '35', '110', 'The facility was under construction adding a major process and was not able to devote any time to energy saving recommendations in the past year. The analyst is working setting up a follow up call date. Two comments they provided for our report was:\n1.        The dry kilns are dehumidification kilns, therefore the boiler does not run continuously.\n\n2.        The economics of the cost of natural gas has changed, we switched to an interruptible\n\nrate schedule which lowered the price from approximately $1.00/therm to $.60/therm.\n', '', '0', '0', 0, '0000-00-00', '', '0'),
