(784, 842, 878, 1, 'Dave Kuns DEQ: E3 Project', '2016-07-19', '2016-11-29', '2018-03-07', '6', '3471', '332813', '10000000', '81', '35000', 'Finished Metals', '15000000', '4680', '25', '2.5', '2396', '100', '55', '120', 'In general, the facility has been busy consolidating two facilities into one. They have implemented one recommendation and plan to do another soon. The savings were more significant as estimated.\n\nContact said to reach out a year from now to see other progress as consolidation is in the past.', 'Facility replaced steam boiler with more efficient one. This happened Feb 2017.', '.05', '23569', 0, '2019-03-07', '', ''),
