(787, 844, 895, 1, '', '2016-09-12', '2016-11-29', '2017-07-27', '3', '2951', '324121', '10000000', '6', '80000', 'Asphalt Products', '11000', '1837', '100', '75', '0', '0', '14', '100', 'The report was very helpful and easy to read. Discussing a variety of issues with the folks from the energy audit was a great experience for me as a professional. They brought a whole slate of knowledge and new ideas to the table, and even the ideas that we did not implement in the end opened up a variety of new avenues to explore. Often proceedures and methods at a plant like ours become established without a lot of consideration, and anything that makes you rethink those from a new perspective is valuable. \nI don\'t know of another action we took besides what was in the report. But generally discussing and describing our entire operation to a team of smart people who asked incisive questions was very valuable to me, and most likely began the incubation of new ideas whether they were specifically brought up by the team or not.\nThe plan was helpful and easy to understand. \nThanks so much for the report.', '', '0.1', '17013', 0, '0000-00-00', '', ''),
