(161, 225, 1550, 2, 1, NULL, '2012-11-07', 'Intro call. Their natural gas should be well over the additional $30 K in energy cost we need to get over $100 total with electric. Happy to have audit when it can work. This term, and start or end of break all sound fine.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
