(163, 225, 1551, 1, 1, NULL, '2012-10-24', 'Emailed to follow up on summer conversation and interest to hold off until after October.\n\n______\nHi Misty,\n\nI thought I would check in again. Would you like to have the OSU Industrial Assessment Center team visit for an assessment this fall? The last time we spoke you wanted to wait until now. \n\nLet me know. I am looking forward to working with you.\n\nThanks!', 2, NULL, NULL),
