(200, 225, 1565, 1, 1, 0, '2013-01-10', 'Called after reading article on EEC. I called back. Wonders how we can work together. Perhaps come down and present to us. \n\nGovernor really pushing conversation and energy efficiency. Need  to step up game with SELP. (Tom Elliot the new Kip. )\n\nTold him I would talk to the team and get back to him next week. ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
