(205, 225, 1567, 1, 1, NULL, '2013-01-18', 'Hi Rich,\n\nI am following up on Kevin\'s introduction. I would be glad to arrange a trip to your facility to identify cost effective opportunities to reduce your costs or even increase your throughput. The assessments are paid for by U.S.DOE so we do put a special focus on energy efficiency but do not stop there.\n\nIt sounds like you would be eligible as a manufacturer. I expect your energy costs exceed $100,000 annually. That is U.S.DOE\'s criteria to pick up the cost with no additional cost to you other than working with us the day we visit. \n\nI am attaching a sample report to give you an idea of what we do along with a letter that provides more detail on our process and the information we collect to prepare before we visit. If you give me your number, I\'d be glad to give you a call to explain more, or of course your are welcome to call me at the number below. \n\nI look forward to an opportunity to work with you!.\n\n- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, NULL),
