(235, 225, 1591, 1, 1, NULL, '2013-03-11', 'Pre audit letter sent:\n\nIt was good to talk today. I look forward to bringing a team to spend three days at your facilities in the week of March 25-29 to perform an assessment.\n\nI\'ve attached the letter I mentioned when we spoke. It outlines our assessment process and what we need to collect to prepare for an assessment. The critical things to return to get things rolling are the:\nIndustrial Pre-Assessment Form\nUtility Release (so we can collect a one year month-to-month profile of your energy use and utility expenses)\nThe letter also includes a list of additional helpful preparatory information. While they are not required, they are helpful and can improve the job we are able to do for you. Please call me if you have any questions. I look forward to working with you. Thanks!\n\n-Joe Junker.\n\n(You might also want to visit our web-site to find out more about our program: http://eec.engr.oregonstate.edu/)', NULL, NULL, NULL),
