(243, 225, 1597, 2, 1, NULL, '2013-03-22', 'Talked to Dan. End of June could be a problem if a project scheduled to be done early June slides. Suggest July. I said late July likely & that we could work to dial it in. \n\nMentioned they had imp some but not all items from last time. Still not imp sparge tank improvment. Also wanted to talk about liquid ring vacuum pump. Temp an issue had to deliver 1000gpm of water to avoid vaporizing cooling water. Still at 20 deg gain. Went to pump for motive force for ejector. Did get rid of shell and tube HT EX. Have old report and quite familiar with our product. Said I would email letter and follow up early April. dan.t.beck@saint-gobain.com', 37, NULL, NULL),
