(254, 225, 1605, 2, 1, NULL, '2013-04-04', 'Shooting for last week in June - Avoid scheduling it for Wed - too many meetings that day. Went over our process and their plant activity. They make imitation crab. Purchase surimi from other facilities. Refrigeration and boiers. (2 steam boilers - one lead one standby - Three spiral freezers - 6 compressors. Going as cold as - 20 deg F. Ammonia system. Pasteurized from 200 deg F to 32 deg F in 10 minutes. Heat exchanger uses chilled and heated water. No regeneration - working on that now. ', 39, NULL, NULL),
