(336, 325, 1640, 2, 1, NULL, '2013-06-13', 'Called Brad this morning and reassessed the situations with Universal Forest Products.  The plan to shift to a new facility in Silverton is no longer being pursued.  They are now interested in an assessment at their Woodburn facility.  Went over the IAC criteria to make sure they qualified and Brad confirmed that they did.  They have about $160,000 per year in energy bills or about $15,000 per month.  They have less than 500 employees and are classified as a manufacturer.  Brad may be unavailable over the course of the next week do to some personal business he has to take care of but he should be reachable via his cell phone(9705662134).  Brad indicated that they would be interested in an assessment sometime in July or August.', 57, NULL, NULL),
