(429, 225, 1654, 1, 1, 10850, '2013-08-08', 'Good morning Joe,\n \nI spoke with our electricians  and we have two air compressors onsite.  The 300 hp one does have a VFD on it.  The other one is 150 hp and it does not have a VFD.  We have had data loggers on both of them, so that data should be available.\n ', NULL, 749, NULL),
(430, 225, 1649, 1, 1, NULL, '2013-08-12', 'Uses enough energy, concerned about secrecy of proprietary process. Will have to get corp buy in. Interested though. Send Pre-Audit doc. Told him on spot left in fall more in winter on. ', 59, NULL, NULL),
