(432, 279, 1639, 1, 0, NULL, '2013-08-12', 'Joseph,\n            I have just faxed you back the release form to look at our account at PGE\nI also attached a copy of the front page of our bill incase you need any more information to talk to PGE.\n \nAny other question, don\'t hesitate to call or email.\n \nThanks,\nDavid Wynn\nAmerican Precision Ind. Inc.\nCorp. Ph. 503-642-5611\nDirect: 503-352-1919\n \n \nFrom: Joseph F. Junker [mailto:joseph.f.junker@gmail.com] \nSent: Friday, August 02, 2013 12:51 PM\nTo: David Wynn\nCc: OSU IAC Manage List\nSubject: Assessment offer: American Precision Industries (Re: Energy audit / production audit)\n\n\nJoseph F. Junker <joseph.f.junker@gmail.com>\n4:04 PM (0 minutes ago)\n\nto David, OSU \nThanks David, Much appreciated! \n\nBy the way when I looked at our calendar I realized that it would be better for us to set October 16th as our target date (keeping the 9th in mind as an alternative).  Would that be fine with you?\n\n- Joe\n', 54, NULL, NULL),
