(435, 318, 1607, 1, 1, 10461, '2013-08-12', 'This is the response from Gloria and the Client Review:\n\nOn AR\n \nNo. 4 â€“ you refer to strainers â€“ there are existing strainers on that system so weâ€™re not sure what â€œstrainersâ€ they are referring to. \nNo. 6 â€“ Could you check the fire codes to see what issues that would develop â€“ that would change the cost of capturing that heat.\nNo. 7 â€“ You mention a vibrating strainer system â€“ could you clarify a type â€“ make and model that your referring to? \n \nOtherwise we look forward to the final copy â€“ and will be sending it off to our Central Resource Team (CRT) for them to evaluate your math and your finds. \n ', 43, 735, NULL),
