(442, 225, 1684, 1, 1, NULL, '2013-08-19', '\nJuliana Ruble JulianaR@rfpco.com Aug 14 \n\nI finally tracked down who has seen the energy efficiency report that you called me about.\n \nNeal VanDoren\n541-679-2126\nnealv@rfpco.com\nHas the Dillard Ply report\n\nLance Elam\n541-679-2157\nlance@rfpco.com\nHas the Coquille mill report from 2007\n \nHope this helps,\n \nJuliana Ruble\nCapital Project Coordinator\nRoseburg Forest Products\n541-679-2781\n541-315-8170 (cell)\n ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
