(460, 69, 1404, 2, 1, NULL, '2013-09-05', 'Jerry Called back. Will have his assistant prepare answers to the email I sent. Was extremely happy with the report. Very well put together and easy to read. They were able to apply the model of our analysis at other facilities at King County. Had some \"professional\" reports prepared and they just were not even near to the quality of the report you provided. ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
