(582, 333, 1639, 1, 0, -1, '2013-10-21', 'David, Jeremy,\n  I have attached a trip report which briefly summarizes our assessment and the opportunities that we have identified for recommendation.  Please feel free to email me with any questions or comments you may have regarding the report. \n The data loggers we installed should finish recording tomorrow at 5 am and can be removed and shipped after that time. As soon as we have that data, we will begin generating recommendations for this report. \n Regards,\n Scott Lindbloom\n', NULL, 756, 764),
