(587, 310, 1710, 1, 0, NULL, '2013-10-25', 'Hi Derrick,\n\nI am following up on the voice mail I just left you.  We have received your Industrial Pre-Assessment Form and Utility Release but we still need a little bit more information.  In order to collect your utility bills from the utility companies I will need the all of the account numbers that you have with them.  If you could add those numbers on to the Utility Release and fax it over again or just reply to this email with them, that would be great!\n\nSecondly, when are the best date ranges for us to visit?  We are looking to schedule more assessments at any time from January 1st, 2014 and onward.\n\nIf you have any questions please feel free to give me a call.\n\nThank you,', NULL, -1, 760),
