(686, 315, 1727, 2, 0, NULL, '2014-01-30', 'Called Jodie to follow-up on an earlier email to propose a facility visit on Monday 3/24. She explained that this date will likely work. Operation hours at this facility are 5:30 am to 2 pm, but they often operate past 2. Therefore it may be a good idea to start at 7 am. She said she would send a completed utility release form. She also said that she could probably schedule maintenance people and other personnel to assist us on the assessment. I walked her through the facility visit process and told her that we would be in touch with her in the next two weeks to schedule a pre-audit call.', NULL, 761, 807),
