(698, 225, 1730, 1, 0, NULL, '2014-03-05', 'Talked to Lori and Darrel. Followed up with Pre Audit.docBackground activated sludge municipal, oxidation ditch, clarifiers, 5000 kWH. Demand from starting of large influent pumps, dryer months, start to check on that. 4-500. Soft start - dumb VFD. Aerobic digestion.  Holding tank. No pump efficiency monitoring process. Knows GPM expected from pump. Some vfds could log the power data. Influent pumps 4. - Obligation to implement? No just to participate in assessment and give feed back on actions. TImeframe - Wed not so good. Other than that, Thursday best. Then Friday 2nd best. After March. I told them for us somewhere in April through June the likely visit time.\\\\ ', NULL, -1, 810),
