(728, 332, 1746, 2, 0, 11308, '2014-04-02', 'Called Patrick to ask about specs on air compressors. Good contact for future air compressor specs in Seattle area. Also referred me to Mark Schekler for me detailed studies regarding optimal operation hours for maintaining air compressors.', NULL, 764, NULL),
(729, 332, 1745, 2, 0, 11323, '2014-04-03', 'Talked with Mark (he installed the compressors at this facility) regarding how often the VFD compressor needed rest. He said that the current practice of running the fixed speed compressor for 1,000 hours was unnecessary, and probably did not entail any significant maintenance savings for the VFD compressor. Originally, the fixed speed compressor was put in as a backup. <br><br> When I directly asked Mark if the fixed speed needed to run at all, he said it might be beneficially to turn it on once a month just to keep it functioning.', NULL, 764, NULL),
