(743, 225, 1612, 1, 0, NULL, '2014-04-17', 'Hi Alan,I wanted to check in regarding the Weyerhaeuser Santiam Mill\'s interest in an assessment. I just received multiple audit requests that could fill the remainder of my slots for this summer. But if you think they might want us to visit this summer I can hold a slot open for them. Of course we will continue scheduling audits next fall forward so if they are interested but on a longer planning horizon that is fine too. Thanks - Let me Know - Joe', NULL, -1, 819),
(744, 225, 1612, 2, 0, NULL, '2014-04-17', 'Alan called to let me know things will be on hold. Main contact there had infection from open wound swimming in lake Shasta, met him last week - seemed ok - died on Sunday. Still would like to work with them later - say this fall. Two facilities actually - Santiam Mill in Lebanon and (?) mill in  Sweet Home.  ', NULL, -1, 819),
(745, 225, 1401, 1, 0, NULL, '2014-03-31', 'Good seeing you in Portland just before Spring break.  I am just back in the office and would like to follow-up on our discussion regarding have a small team work with you on an energy project this summer. It sounded like your first interest was to do a lot off data logging to characterize your systems better. You also mentioned DENT instruments as a natural partner as they are neighbors. This all sounds interesting to me. Is there a good time to call to explore the possibilities more?He said yes and we scheduled call to talk about it on Tuesday April 8th ', NULL, -1, 314),
