(772, 225, 1765, 2, 0, NULL, '2014-06-12', 'I called him back - told him I was traveling and would call on return to the office. It sounds like a long horizon discussion - for next summer maybe. He works at a (Washington State?) plant but they (supports?) the Alaska plants. Found big savings opportunities but does ont have much time. Hoped we could help. Told him we would have to find a way to pay for the travel - but yes - could be interested. ', NULL, -1, 822),
