(785, 225, 1549, 1, 0, -1, '2014-07-07', 'LVM IMP', NULL, -1, 646),
(786, 333, 1744, 1, 0, 11529, '2014-07-08', 'Julia, Bill, Our data recorders are now finished capturing amperage data for the three ammonia compressors. They can be removed from the disconnect panels and shipped back in the yellow case we left on site during our visit. The data recorder can be unplugged from the transducer to make removal and shipping easier.  Thanks for your help, Scott Lindbloom OSU Energy Efficiency Center', NULL, 770, 813),
(787, 225, 1618, 1, 0, -1, '2014-07-08', 'IMP Interveiw: OK to use for case study once controls are in, or quote sooner. ', NULL, -1, 182),
(788, 225, 1771, 1, 0, NULL, '2014-07-09', 'Good morning! Wed like to apply for an energy assessment.We currently have a sustainability & energy team, but will be rolling those into one.We are landfill free and attempting to reduce energy consumption through compressed air reduction, boiler management, LED installations and energy policies. How do I apply for this service?', NULL, -1, 823),
(789, 225, 1771, 1, 0, NULL, '2014-07-09', 'Hi Brian,I just left you voice mail. I would be pleased to schedule an assessment for your facility. As it turns out I just had one audit postponed so I have an opening in August. I am heading out of town until mid next week so I will give you a call then. In the mean time I am attaching our standard letter offering an assessment. It outlines our assessment process and will give you and idea of what we need to collect to best prepare for an assessment. It also includes a list of additional helpful preparatory information. While not required, these items are helpful and can greatly improve the job we are able to do for you. I am assuming you will meet the U.S.DOE required minimum annual energy cost of $100,000 (for all energy types: Electric, Natural Gas, Propane, etc).If you would like to get things rolling key things to return are the:Industrial Pre-Assessment Form (that includes eligibility and logistic information)Utility Release (so we can collect a one year month-to-month profile of your energy use and utility expenses)I will look forward to talking to you next week. Thanks!-Joe Junker.', NULL, -1, 823),
(790, 225, 1771, 2, 0, NULL, '2014-07-17', 'LVM and EM: Hi Brian,I am back in town and following up on last week. Give me a call. ', NULL, -1, 823),
(791, 225, 1765, 2, 0, NULL, '2014-07-17', 'LVM - got ok to proceed from U.S.DOE, Rutgers and Boise. Give me a call. ', NULL, -1, 822),
(792, 334, 1567, 1, 0, -1, '2014-07-17', 'Colleen,   AR 1.  The moisture meter was relocated to inside the facility rather than adding additional moisture controls. 2/14 The cost to add additional moisture controls once we received quotes exceeded $40K not including the various installation and programming and according to the people we discussed this with we could not achieve the $145k savings. This has helped get quicker results to the operators.  AR 2. The property owner is currently installing new high efficiency lighting on the remaining 13 fixtures we have been using that were the old style halide fixtures. Estimated actual savings on these 13 fixtures will be around $400 7/14 AR 3. We have done anything on this one yet. AR 4. We have repaired all of the air hose leaks in our portion of the plant. 3/14 The property owner still has the overhead lines to check but it hasnt been completed as of yet. They will probably not make a big investment on this one time or money. We have also considered getting our own compressor sized correctly for our needs but by the time you factor in purchasing installation and maintenance costs it doesn\'t save us to run our own compressor.  Hope this helps and provides you some feedback.', NULL, -1, 734),
