(813, 333, 1744, 1, 0, -1, '2014-08-20', 'Hi Julia,  We have finished our report of the assessment at your facility and I have attached it for your review.  We will send it to printing the week of 9/22, so if there are any details you would like changed please let us know before that time.  I will be away from the office from 8/26 until 9/22. During this time if you have questions about the report, feel free to contact Vincent Albright: albrighv@onid.oregonstate.edu.  Thank you for the opportunity to visit the facility. ', NULL, 770, 813),
