(948, 225, 1906, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-21', 'Hi Diana,Was Murphy interested in having us visit? Any other ideas of sites we could visit along the way to or in southern Oregon in late June?(By the way, I think I neglected to copy you, but Kristana Lee at Roseburg Forest Products - Dillard checked in regarding working there this summer. We are working on a late July visit perhaps)Thanks !- Joe', NULL, -1, 846),
(949, 225, 1467, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-04-28', 'Hi Jackson,Seems it has been awhile. I thought I would touch base to see if you have any new Pacific Seafood sites you would like to have an Industrial Assessment Center team assess?. U.S.DOE increased our funding mid year so we now have openings for ~ 10 more site visits between now and October 1. The key criteria is that the site has over $100,000 a year in energy costs. Hope all is going well for you.- Joe Junker', NULL, -1, 193),
