(951, 225, 1467, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-21', 'Hi Jackson,I thought I would check in. Does it look like you have any potential sites for us to visit this summer?Thanks (hope you have been enjoying the weather)- Joe', NULL, -1, 193),
(952, 225, 1612, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-07', 'Hi Alan,Good talking to you today. All three of the facilities you mentioned (Entek and the two Weyerhaeuser Mills) would be interesting assessments I think. I am attaching the brochures I mentioned for the Energy Efficiency Center (EEC) and our main project, the Industrial Assessment Center (IAC).I would enjoy working with you again. Thanks - Joe', NULL, -1, 848),
(953, 225, 1450, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-02-23', 'Hi Christina,Do you think you might have one or two more sites for us to visit this summer when we come down to assess Carestream Inc.? It really helps us leverage our costs to visit a couple sites when we travel south.  (I would like to set that trip up for late June.) One potential option might be to re-visit a place we have not been to in the last 5 years such as one of these sites:Amy\'s Kitchen Harry & DavidRogue Valley Door Sabroso Panel Products LLC Timber Products Cascade Wood Products Sierra Pine Bentwood Industries auditThanks - Joe', NULL, -1, 845),
(954, 225, 1450, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-04-29', 'Hello Joe, I do not have any new prospects as of yet, I will keep poking around. ThanksChristina', NULL, -1, 845),
(955, 225, 1450, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-21', 'Ok Thanks Christina - I\'ll put a reminder on my calendar. Hmmm other folks in your area that I would enjoy working with again might be:Amy\'s KithcenHarry and David\'sSabrosoCascade Wood ProductsHambro Forest Products WoodgrainPanel ProductsCollins ProductsDo you think any of them might be interested? (Of course any other industrial clients you might suggest would be welcome)- Joe- JoeOn Thu, May 21, 2015 at 2:19 PM, Kruger, Christina <Christina.Kruger@pacificorp.com> wrote:Hello Joe I connected with Brad Beavers at TP and due to a major project he has undertaken he is unable to participate in your program this year. That said, he would be interested in giving it a whirl again in the future. We just need to nudge him again next year or even later this year. ThanksChristina', NULL, -1, 845),
(956, 225, 1423, 2, 0, NULL, '2015-05-07', 'Possible CLients:Darigold - seattle issaquaTirident seafood - tacoma seattle anacortesCampbell - stockpot soupsContinental Mills - blenderNewlywed foodsAnother  in - Linden WashingonFrozen vegetable processor in ChehalisWoodland & westport wa', NULL, -1, 655),
(957, 225, 1423, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-07', 'Hi John,It was good talking to you today,  I am enthusiastic about the idea of collaborating with you in assessments of some of your clients. Sounds like you have quite a few potential sites we could work with.  (Darigold in Seattle & Issaquah; Trident Seafoods in Tacoma, Seattle & Anacortes; Campbell - stockpot soups; Continental Mills; Newly Weds Foods; and some other plants in Linden,  Chehalis, Woodland & Westport)I am attaching the brochures I mentioned for the Energy Efficiency Center (EEC) and our main project, the Industrial Assessment Center (IAC).As a reminder - I think the ideal weeks for us to travel north are the weeks of June 22nd or of June 29th. (Although - if that is just not an option - we could look at scheduling the trip for Mid to late July or August.)I look forward to working with you.Thanks - Joe', NULL, -1, 655),
(958, 225, 1637, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-02-24', 'Hello Andreas,I have begun planning for our summer audits trips this year. I wondered if you might have any clients that you thought might be good candidates for one of our audits? I would like to work on setting up a trip in your direction for late June this year.Thanks - hope all is well your way - Joe Junker', NULL, -1, 767),
(959, 225, 1637, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-02-26', 'Hi Andreas,I have had a student working on marketing materials and she just prepared the two attached brochures: one on the Energy Efficiency Center and one on our Industrial Assessment Center program. I thought they might be of use to you in discussions with your customers. On the same vein you might find this link to a  sample OSU Industrial Assessment Center report helpful.Thanks- Joe', NULL, -1, 767),
(960, 225, 1637, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-02-25', 'Hi Joe, Yes, I may actually have some. I may need to ask the customer first and I will get back to you. Thanks Joe, Andreas', NULL, -1, 767),
(961, 225, 1637, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-04-28', 'Hi Andreas,I am back from travel. I thought I would follow up to see if you have come across any potential clients we could visit this summer - probably June ?(We went to new Zealand - just for fun I am attaching  a video clip of a cute little fella we met along the way ;-)', NULL, -1, 767),
(962, 225, 1637, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-04-29', 'Hi Joe, Nice video, New Zealand must be fun. I spend 1 month in Auckland when I was in High school like 20+  years ago for a student exchange program, but I heard they have changed a lot since then.I will keep you posted on potential customer, we are on planning process, so it is kind of hectic in here. Andreas ', NULL, -1, 767),
(963, 225, 1906, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-22', 'Ok Murphy Rogue River would like to schedule an audit. The contact will be Tom Hammett. Do you know a date in June yet? Diana KnousGlad to hear it! We have not locked in the week to travel South yet, but I am targeting either the week of June 22nd or June 29th. Do you know if either or both work for Murphy Rogue River? Let me know if you would like me to follow up with Tom.Thanks Diana - Joe', NULL, -1, 846),
(964, 225, 1817, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-22', 'Good Morning Krisinda, (Jack)We are looking forwarding to visiting your facility this summer for an assessment. Would it work for you to have us spend a day at your site in the week of June 22nd or June 29th?  (We are working on scheduling a trip to your area  to visit you and a couple of other industrial plants.)Let me know. Thanks! - Joe Junker ', NULL, -1, 821),
(965, 225, 1816, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-22', 'Good Morning Krisinda, (Jack)We are looking forwarding to visiting your facility this summer for an assessment. Would it work for you to have us spend a day at your site in the week of June 22nd or June 29th?  (We are working on scheduling a trip to your area  to visit you and a couple of other industrial plants.)Let me know. Thanks! - Joe Junker Good Morning Joe, I will have to check with the facilities team on the dates. How many people are coming? We are looking forward to working with your team. Maintenance and Facilities Manager MFAPS/ Manufacturing   Jack.Magliocco@carestreamhealth.com  Office: 541-831-7220 Fax: 541-831-7164 Cell: 541-227-4844 Hi Jack,We would typically bring 4-5 students and a faculty member. With your permission we would also like to invite Christina Kruger, Pacific Power - to join us. By the way, earlier this year I sent a letter including a request for some information to help up prepare for our visit. It would be great to get that back soon so my team can start preparing. Would it help to send it again?Thanks - Joe Junker', NULL, -1, 821),
