(969, 225, 1586, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-01-21', 'Hi Doug,Good seeing you at the Energy Summit. We talked about potential for setting up IAC assessments with any of your clients. I promised (threatened? ;) to send a reminder email.  My team told me they talked to you about a winery audit.  In any case it would be good to work with you again. Let me know what you think. Thanks - JoeJoe,Thanks for your email/reminder! Ill chew on this and consider which customers would be good candidates to reach out to for a (possibly repeat) assessment. It was good to see you at the Summit last week!Doug PS  I dont recall being approached about a winery audit. To my knowledge, the only wineries in our service territory would be little mom & pop operations in a garage with minimal load. Perhaps your team was thinking of another utility(?).Thanks Doug. Always good to connect. I hope you can think of someone for us to work with. I will have to ask students if they can remember who they (really ;-) spoke to. - Joe', NULL, -1, NULL),
(970, 225, 1586, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-22', 'Hey Doug,How are things? I thought I would send a note before the Holiday. I will call to follow up next week. I am looking to set up a trip through your area in the end of June and wondered if you might have come across someone that might like to have us visit.(The trip is to Kent, so we could visit along the way, but if that is not the ideal time-frame, we could also come up some other time in the summer)Talk to you next week. Have a nice weekend - JoeHi Joe,Thanks for your email. Unfortunately, Ive been too consumed with other work lately to generate/send any promotions for the IAC assessments  sorry! Ive had it on my do-do list for a while, but other priorities keep pushing it back. Ill let you know if I can find a good candidate in the next week or two. Hope you have a great weekend.Thanks,Doug', NULL, -1, NULL),
(971, 225, 1691, 2, 0, NULL, '2015-05-21', 'Sam called to inquire about audits. Told him I would send the pre-audit doc and a PDF copy of the old reports (Boardman too)- Sent PReaudit', NULL, -1, 501),
(972, 225, 1908, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-02-26', 'Hi Peter,It has been a little while since we last communicated about potential to offer your industrial clients our no-cost U.S.DOE funded industrial efficiency assessments. I am in the process of scheduling audits trips for this summer and wondered if you would like to have us plan to travel in your direction? Might you have any industrial clients that could benefit from our services?. (If you are trying to remember what we deliver, here is a link to a sample OSU Industrial Assessment Center report )I am also attaching PDF brochures on the OSU Energy Efficiency Center and our Industrial Assessment Center program. Thanks - I hope we get an opportunity to collaborate this summer.- Joe', NULL, -1, 665),
(973, 225, 1586, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-22', 'Hi Skyler,Per his email below, Joe Junker of the OSU Industrial Assessment Center (funded by Department of Energy) is looking for industrial facilities that might be interested in one of their energy assessments. They prefer facilities with a total annual energy expenditure ranging between $100,000 and $2 million, so youre right in their sweet spot. The assessments are performed by a team consisting of an OSU engineering faculty member and about a half-dozen graduate students. They typically include one or two days of onsite investigation and data collection by the team. Roughly 60 days later, the participating facility receives a comprehensive report (sample attached) identifying specific recommendations and supporting details. There is no cost to participants other than the staff-time to facilitate the teams onsite investigation. Attached is a handout with additional details about the assessments. I informed Darren Gellerson of this opportunity a couple years ago, but nothing came of it. If this would be of interest to you, let me know and Id be happy put you in touch with Joe Junker (or feel free to contact him yourself  his email and phone # are shown below). Best Regards,Doug', NULL, -1, 103),
(974, 225, 1913, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-05-22', 'Doug, Thanks for the heads up. Sounds like a great program (helps they are from OSU), I will check in with Darren and see if he thinks it would be a good fit for Longview. Will let you know when I hear more. Have a great holiday weekend,  Skyler  ', NULL, -1, 103),
