(1200, 225, 1969, 2, 0, NULL, '2015-07-13', 'VM from : Rick Stringfield - Pennington Crossarm Company - Eugene - Refered to us by Tom Siimpson NWNG and Josh Ruddick & Steve Mangen EWEB - regarding industrial assesssment. Associcated with zippo log mils - produce crossarms - have dry kilns, planers, incicsors molders etc. Intersted in assessment. Call Office 541/228-3625 Cell 503-467-1887 - rstringfield@crossarms.com. Hope to hear from you. ', NULL, -1, 867),
(1201, 225, 1969, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-07-15', 'Produce crossarms and perform custom planing and drying surfacing for other millsproduce associated hardware.pressure treat off site.Would like to reduce energy cost. Become more efficient. Reduce DemandEWEB and NWNG described - GluLam line coming on board. Plant built in mid 80s boring molders incisorsconducted by students  15 people. Eweb has been data loggingHp by machine centerLighting: MH? HPS? looking at Looking at controlling their Demand.Down to one shift. into less economical rate schedule. Added dry kiln. on Different transformer  - combine the two meters?NWNG working to get on interruptible rate. Humidification kilns, steam boiler for kilns. Concerned about pipes freeze on interrupt.Told him I would send the preaudit letter and brochures. ', NULL, -1, 867),
