(1207, 347, 1971, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-07-15', 'Mike Layfield,My name is Megan O\'Leary and I\'m an Energy Analyst at Oregon State\'s Energy Efficiency Center.We offer FREE energy and productivity assessments. A team of engineering students from OSU would visit your facility for one day, take copious notes and develop 5-10 recommendations that typically total hundreds of thousands of dollars in annual savings and pay back in about a year.We\'ve got some availability in the next few months and if you\'re interested, I would love to send you a more detailed email with more information that explains what we do. That email will also have the initial steps to take if Cascade Steel Rolling Mills is interested in a free assessment.Best regards,Megan O\'LearyEnergy AnalystEnergy Efficiency CenterOregon State University', NULL, -1, 868),
(1208, 347, 1971, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-07-16', 'Hello Megan, We would be interested in seeing a more detailed email. Thank you for reaching out to CSRM. Michael LayfieldGeneral Manager, OperationsCascade Steel Rolling MillsA Division of Schnitzer Steel Industries, Inc.3200 North Hwy 99WMcMinnville, OR 97128(503) 434-3217 ', NULL, -1, 868),
