(1235, 352, 1916, 1, 0, 12107, '2015-07-29', 'Hi Scott,I have been looking into the possibility of using the automatic forklifts for your packaging/shipping process step and I have a question for you. Using the production data you provided (attached), I calculated about 122 hours of idle time a month. This seems a little high with your initial estimate of 10 hours a month. Does this seem like a poor estimate? Just so I am clear on some of the data, is \"percent utilization\" how much time the robot is actually working (40% utilization means 60% idle time)? Thank you for your time,', NULL, 794, 856),
