(1246, 352, 1765, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-08-04', 'Hi Jeff,This is Anthony Mizener with the Energy Efficiency Center at Oregon State, I will be leading the audit scheduled for next week. I wanted to touch base with you and set up a pre-audit phone call. The purpose of this call is to familiarize ourselves with your systems and operations so we can have an idea of what to look for coming in, as well as ironing out some details of our visit. Would you be available tomorrow at 12:30? If this time doesn\'t work, let me know and we can find a time that does.Thank you,', NULL, NULL, 866),
