(1248, 353, 1982, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-08-05', 'Hey Dale,My name is Benjamin Bellman and I will be leading our upcoming trip to Trident Seafoods\' Everette plant. Before we leave for our trip to visit the various Trident plants, I was hoping to schedule a pre-audit call with yourself or anyone who is familiar with the plant operations. This call is intended to familiarize ourselves with your systems and operations. A quick example of some of topics we are hoping to discuss are as follow::Your biggest energy usersWhat opportunities would you like us to focus on?Schedule details including arrival time, lunch, etc Plant policies such as safety gear, permission to take photos, common practices you would like us to follow, etc.For scheduling purposes, I was hoping to set this call up for some time between 12 noon - 3 PM tomorrow. Please let me know if this time frame works and when you would be free to talk.I look forward to talking with you and am excited for the upcoming trip to your facility.', NULL, NULL, 864),
