(1256, 225, 1989, 2, 0, NULL, '2015-08-05', 'Wanted to get a sense of the process. Blair Hasler (IAC Alumni) and Rebecca ? are their ETO contacts. Likely about to participate in ETO Strategic Energy Management program starting October 1. September 21, 22,23 ok. Monday (21st) not good for Hardboard plant - startup day - things can go wrong. Plan 21 for lumber 22 for hardboard. Consider moving Lumber to 23. Sending Preaudit Material again. & old reports.', NULL, NULL, 486),
