(1281, 341, 1919, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-08-20', 'Nathan,Thank you for the previous information provided. When I left the facility I did not have time to talk to the Powerhouse manager or someone who would know the average operation of the fan damper positioning (or better a log of the positions). I left a voicemail detailing this as well. If you could provide me a phone number or email that would be much appreciated.Thank you,Tyler GiddingsOperations ManagerEnergy Efficiency CenterOregon State University(650) 759-0987', NULL, NULL, 545),
(1282, 351, 2007, 1, 0, NULL, '2015-08-25', 'Rod,I just wanted to let you know that we were unable to find someone to fill this role and had to unfortunately change the way we were going with the video (the dead line in next week). I wanted to thank you though for how much you tried to help!  It is greatly appreciated and we will remember you for the next time we have anything to do with acting!I hope your summer has been going well!-AnyaFrom: \"Rod Davidson\" <rwd44@comcast.net>To: anyajean@comcast.netSent: Thursday, August 13, 2015 10:19:51 AMSubject: Re: Help Finding Actor for OSU Energy Efficiency Center\'s VideoAnya, it just occurred to me - if I can be of help to you the day of the shoot with any of the actors, let me know. RodFrom: anyajean@comcast.netTo: \"Rod Davidson\" <rwd44@comcast.net>Sent: Thursday, August 13, 2015 10:02:45 AMSubject: Re: Help Finding Actor for OSU Energy Efficiency Center\'s VideoRod,Thank you very much! I really appreciate your help!-AnyaFrom: \"Rod Davidson\" <rwd44@comcast.net>To: \"Anya Lehman\" <anyajean@comcast.net>Sent: Wednesday, August 12, 2015 9:03:27 AMSubject: Re: Help Finding Actor for OSU Energy Efficiency Center\'s VideoAnya, I forwarded your email to a lady who works with young girls in a dance group in the right age range. I just worked with them last night. If any of them are interested they were told to contact you right away. Good luck. Rod From: \"Anya Lehman\" <anyajean@comcast.net>To: rwd44@comcast.netSent: Tuesday, August 11, 2015 9:07:44 AMSubject: Help Finding Actor for OSU Energy Efficiency Center\'s VideoHello Mr. Davidson,My name is Anya Lehman and I work at the Energy Efficiency Center at Oregon State University.  We are filming an educational video this month and would like to include a younger child.  This video will be entered in a contest for the Center for Advanced Energy Systems at Rutgers University. We thought we would reach out to you and see if anyone you are in contact with might be interested in getting more acting experience this August. Do you perhaps know of anyone who might be interested?  The ideal candidate we are looking for is a girl, age 7-12, who would be willing to participate in a video modeled after Bill Nye the Science Guy.  We would film the video on campus and would hope to complete the filming in a couple of hours.  If you know of anyone who would be interested in participating, I would appreciate it if you would pass along my contact information. Or if you have any advice on how we should go forward with finding someone to fill this role that would also be great! ly appreciated!Thank you so much for your time,Anya LehmanTraining Database Specialist for OSU\'s Energy Efficiency Centeranyajean@comcast.net or lehmana@onid.oregonstate.edu(503)915-9953', NULL, NULL, NULL),
