(1444, 341, 2145, 1, 0, NULL, '2016-08-16', 'Hello Nancy,I am an Operations Manager at the Oregon State University Industrial Assessment Center. I will be the student analyst that will be in charge of preparing us all for the upcoming energy assessments in Alaska.I have attached our pre-assessment forms to this email and included all the information you have provided the Boise State IAC. It may include some additional information that will give you some more insight on the process and allow you to provide some key details to make our assessment more productive. Specifically we are looking to collect utility bills in order to begin our utility analysis before we arrive.We would like to set up a phone call to go over logistics for the day and get a brief overview of your process. Let me know your availability next week and I will propose a time.We look forward to working with you,', NULL, NULL, 895),
