(1472, 341, 2183, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-02-14', 'Tyler Giddings <giddingt.eec@gmail.com>Attachments6:26 PM (5 minutes ago)to Scott.bacon, Cheryl.Carter, EEC, Joseph Hello Scott,My name is Tyler Giddings and I have prepared our Pre-Assessment Form for you to begin the process for an OSU Energy Efficiency Center assessment. The form is attached below. Please fill it out and send it back to me so we can begin the baseline process. It also contains details on the assessment process and timeline.As Joe said, we have availability after April 3rd. Please call or email me if you have any questions. Thank you for your interest.Best Regards,', NULL, NULL, 391),
