(1504, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-25', 'John Parmigiani sent intro email:  Keith, I had a meeting this morning with an OSU colleague, Joe Junker, and realized his center might be of use to Blount Joe (ccd on this message) is the director of the Energy Efficiency Center which offers no-cost full scope energy and efficiency assessments to industry.He provided the text below and the attached brochure to describe the center.Please feel free to contact Joe directly for more information (at 541/737-5034, or Joe.Junker@oregonstate.edu) or pass this along to others at Blount.-John', NULL, NULL, 913),
