(1506, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-23', 'Good Morning Joe, I have a meeting this morning with the president to discuss this project.  The concern is over the information gathered, specifically pictures and video.  We have a strict no media taken while touring because of trade secrets.  Can you talk more on how that information will be used or if it is necessary in creating the assessment. Thank you, Kyle Pyke | Process Engineer | G. Loomis, Inc.1359 Down River Drive Woodland, WA 98674360-225-6516 ext 232', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1507, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-31', 'Hello Kyle, I thought I would follow up. How did the meeting with your president go. Any interest in going forward on setting up an assessment.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1508, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-31', 'Hi Joe, Thank you for following up.  The meeting went well and we will move forward with the assessment.  He would like me have a NDA or memorandum between LMS and OSU.  As well no photo and video. If that works with you, I will start gathering  information for the pre-assessment. Thanks for your patience, ', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1509, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-31', 'Excellent, I am glad to hear that. No problem on the NDA and photo and video restrictions. We encounter them on a regular basis.I will keep an eye out for the pre-assessment data. In the mean time do you have an idea of when you might like us to visit? A good time for us would be a day in the last week of June. Otherwise, a date later in the summer could also work.Much appreciated. - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1510, 225, 2208, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-31', 'Joe, Thanks for contacting us. I would be interested in learning more about the process and scope of services you typically look at.  Our facilities and maintenance manager (Julie Walter( is currently on vacation, but is a key player in a project like this.  I have ccd her on this email to include her going forward.  She would definitely be involved and I will discuss this with her after she returns next week.  Assuming we move forward with this, we need to think about timing amongst some other projects this summer.  Do you have a timing in mind for the site visit and what are the next steps? Thanks, John   John Wilhelms | General Manager | PDX ManufacturingBlount International | 4909 SE International Way, Portland, OR 97222 T: 503.653.4567 | M: 503-502-9933 | E: john.wilhelms@blount.com ', NULL, NULL, 911),
(1511, 225, 2208, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-01', 'I am glad to hear it John. Regarding timing: we are looking to schedule a visit for a day in the week of June 26. Otherwise we have open days in July after the 13th and early August. In the mean time perhaps we should plan on a conversation next week when Julie is back. Before hand in preparation for the conversation, I will email you our standard pre-audit letter that outlines our process and  the information we work to collect in preparation..Looking forward to working with you.- Joe', NULL, NULL, 911),
(1512, 225, 2208, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-05', 'Hi John, Would you and Julie Walter have time to talk later this week  ..... Let me know if there is a good time for a conversation. Thanks!-Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 911),
(1513, 225, 2206, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-01', 'Joe- This is an interesting proposal Let me float this around and see if the manufacturing folks would like to partake.  Just so I am clear, it looks like your group is interested in both energy use (like facilities) as well as manufacturing processes? Thanks, Larry ', NULL, NULL, 912),
(1514, 225, 2206, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-05', 'Thanks Larry,Yes you are right. We a interested in looking at anything that improves profitability. Whether it is throughput improvements or resource and waste stream cost control. Of course, with our U.S.DOE funding, we make sure to identify energy savings opportunities. I will be interested to hear what your team thinks. If you like, I could send a sample report to give you an idea of what we deliver after our visit. (Fair waning, it is a fairly large attachment ;-)Let me know if any other questions arise.- Joe', NULL, NULL, 912),
(1517, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Hi Kyle, I have not seen the pre-assessment data yet. I wanted to make sure it did not get caught in a spam filter that  I  missed if you sent it.  Also would a day in the last week of June (June 27-30) work for you to have us visit?. If so I would like to get you on our calendar and save the best day for you.- Joe', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1518, 225, 2209, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Joe,                I would be interesting in working with your team on this if you are still looking for participants. We are a manufacturing company with approximately 175,000 sq ft. and 175 people. We run a full manufacturing shop including machining equipment, lasers, paint booths, burn off ovens, welders, plus a lot more. Best Regards,       Mike Mader        Called back - agreed to send Pre-Audit Doc', NULL, NULL, 914),
(1519, 225, 2199, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Hi Kent,I thought I might check in on this. Are you still interested in having us visit for an assessment? Let me know if you have any questions regarding the pre-audit letter I sent. I still have a placeholder in my mind to visit your site for a day  in the last week of June.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 907),
(1520, 225, 2208, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Hi John,I just called and left a message with your assistant.  I was just looking to close the loop on a conversation about setting up an energy assessment. Let me know if there is a good time to connect.Thanks - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 911),
(1521, 225, 2206, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Called Larry, He is waiting for boss to return next week to see if it looks good for them. Call him late next week. ', NULL, NULL, 912),
(1522, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Called Keith, he had left VM asking if we could meet when he is here friday. I agreed to work with John P to pick time and let him know. ', NULL, NULL, 913),
(1523, 353, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Called today. He wants to set up an assessment soon.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1524, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-18', 'David,I am with the Oregon State University Energy Efficiency Center (OSU EEC). We are currently looking to fill our assessment schedule for this upcoming Summer. We visited Rogue Brewery approximately 17 years ago, and wanted to offer our services again.The OSU EEC is a DOE grant funded program, so there would be no cost to your facility for the assessment. We have experience working with other local breweries and think that we can add value to your operations. Here is a link to our website that has more information about our work:-snip-Please let me know if you have any questions. I hope to hear from you soon.Thank you,Ben', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1526, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Hey David, Ill be back in the office this afternoon. Is there a good time to call so we can discuss the first steps in setting up an assessment Let me know. Thank you, Ben', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1528, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-07', 'Hi Joe I requested the information from accounting but will touch base with them tomorrow.  The last week of June looks good to me, possibly Thursday or Friday.  Let me double check that some other personnel are here to assist.  - KyleGreat, thanks, I will tentatively plan on one of those days then. Thanks - Joe', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1529, 225, 2204, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-08', 'Hi Wally,I just left you voice mail as well. I was thinking you got back from your holiday earlier this week if I remembered correctly. I wanted to check if you had any questions on the pre-audit letter we sent, or the data we asked for. I also wanted to confirm if you still thought the last week in June will be the right date to target. (I am working to start locking in my summer calendar.)Hope you had a good break.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 909),
(1530, 353, 2210, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-08', 'Contacted James through my friend who works with Pacific Seafoods marketing team (specifically doing their photography).James expressed interest in meeting in person, so I am trying to set up a phone call and possibly a date where I can meet with him on my way home to Portland.After contacting him, I will send pre-assessment info', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1531, 353, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-08', 'Called david and sent pre-assessment info.', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1532, 225, 2211, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-08', 'Eva called from Portco - wanted to know if the # of people and sales data are for all Portco or just the site. - I said just the site. ', NULL, NULL, 907),
(1533, 225, 2211, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-12', 'Voice Mail Preview:Good afternoon Joe this is Yvette with executive assistant here with port co packaging we were informed by callous PD that you guys are doing a no cost for at scope and again efficiency assessment.And and we would like to hear more information regarding to the give me a call back my number is (360) 841-8201 again this is Yvette with portico packaging and with fund washing 1000360841.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1534, 225, 2199, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-16', 'Sent pre audit and standard email', NULL, NULL, 907),
(1535, 225, 2212, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-08', 'Hi Mark, I was looking to follow-up on our earlier conversation with a quick note but could not find my email to you after we talked.  As I can not find it, I am concerned I did not get it out to you for some reason.  If so my apologies. I was glad to talk to you and learn about your work with some of the regional PUDs. I believe I agreed to send you a copy of our sample report, brochure, pre-audit letter, and  a boiler plate email we have to present our services to potential clients . They are attached or pasted below. Let me know if I missed anything else I should get to you or if any questions come up. I look forward to working with you on another assessment in the future. ', NULL, NULL, 916),
(1536, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-09', 'Met Keith for lunch on campus while he was here to meet John P. Sent pr-audit letter and sample report after. ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1537, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-09', 'Had lunch with John and Keith. Followed up sending sample report and pre-audit letter. They have multiple facilities: Vancouver, Clackamas, a number north in the Seattle Puget Sound area.', NULL, NULL, 913),
(1538, 353, 2210, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-06-12', 'VLM asking for call back', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1539, 353, 2210, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-06-12', 'Sent pre-assessment paperwork', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1540, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-14', 'Hi Kyle, I am following up on voicemail I just left. I wanted to double check with you on a workable day for our visit. We had settled in on Thursday June 29th and if the is the best day lets stick with it. However it looks like another site we want to visit that week is near you. They can only have us come on Tuesday June 27. If it is workable for you, visiting your site on Wednesday June 28 would save us travel time as we could stay over an visit you the next day. Again of course if Thursday June 29th is really better for you lets stick with it Thanks  -Joe', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1541, 225, 2210, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-14', 'Good day James,I just left you voicemail. I was following up on Bens email letting you know of his upcoming departure. (Unfortunately, as always seems to happen, my best student analysts keep graduating on me) I would be glad to work with you to set up an assessment visit.  I can not make a call on the 21st though, as I will be flying to a Directors meeting in New Orleans. Might there be any good times to talk between now and Tuesday June 20th? I have a number of open windows in my calendar in that window.Let me know. I look forward to working with you- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1542, 225, 2195, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-15', 'Called to check on visit date change. No dice. Thursday is the best day for them. ', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1543, 225, 2211, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-15', 'Tuesday the 27th will work. Must do pre-audit call with Ken tomorrow after 2pm or between 3-4 on the 26th. I said we would shoot for tomorrow.', NULL, NULL, 907),
(1544, 225, 2199, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-15', 'Hello Kent,I just spoke to your assistant. I was calling to propose we come on  Tuesday June 27th as that seemed to be the best date for you. She agreed it still worked, so we will plan on it. Thanks- Joe (Apologies, I thought I had replied when you originally sent the email below - but I do not see it in my outbox.)', NULL, NULL, 907),
(1545, 225, 2202, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-15', 'Hi Tim,I just left you voicemail as well. I was calling to propose we set our visit date for Friday June 30.  Will that work for you?(FYI- Once we settle the visit date we would also like to set a time beforehand for a phone conversation to cover logistic details and to learn more about your facility and process to help us prepare.)- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 908),
(1546, 225, 2209, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-15', 'Hi Mike,I would like to propose we set our visit date for Wednesday, June 28.  Will that work for you?(FYI- Once we settle the visit date we would also like to set a time beforehand for a phone conversation to cover logistic details and to learn more about your facility and process to help us prepare.)Thanks!- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 914),
(1548, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi Keith,Sorry to catch you in a meeting. I had called to see if you thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit one of your sites.  I am scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you. I also wanted to know if any questions arose regarding the the Pre-Audit letter I sent you with the sample report after we met.FYI: I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower. I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply. I look forward to working with you to set up an assessment.- Joe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1549, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi Keith,Sorry to catch you in a meeting. I had called to see if you thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit one of your sites.  I am scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you. I also wanted to know if any questions arose regarding the the PreAudit letter I sent you with the sample report after we met.FYI - I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower. I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply. I look forward to working with you to set up an assessment- Joe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1550, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi Keith,Sorry to catch you in a meeting. I had called to see if you thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit one of your sites  I am scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you I also wanted to know if any questions arose regarding the the PreAudit letter I sent you with the sample report after we metFYI I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower. I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply I look forward to working with you to set up an assessmentJoe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1551, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi KeithSorry to catch you in a meeting. I had called to see if you thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit one of your sites  I am scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you I also wanted to know if any questions arose regarding the the PreAudit letter I sent you with the sample report after we metFYI I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower. I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply I look forward to working with you to set up an assessmentJoe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1552, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi KeithSorry to catch you in a meeting. I had called to see if you thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit one of your sites  I am scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you I also wanted to know if any questions arose regarding the the PreAudit letter I sent you with the sample report after we metFYI I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply I look forward to working with you to set up an assessmentJoe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1553, 225, 2208, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi John (Julie)Just touching base to see if you thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit your site for an assessment.  I am now scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you. I also wanted to know if any questions arose regarding the the Pre-Audit letter I sent you.FYI I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower. I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply. I look forward to working with you.- Joe', NULL, NULL, 911),
(1554, 225, 2206, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi Larry,Just touching base to see if you thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit your site for an assessment. Last we spoke, you wanted to get feedback from your team before making a commitment.  I am now scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you. FYI I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower. I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply. I look forward to working with you.- Joe', NULL, NULL, 912),
(1555, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-20', 'Hi David,I am following up on the conversation you have been having with my newly graduated student, Ben Bellman. It has been a long time since our center has worked with Rogue Brewery and I would enjoy the opportunity. I wanted to see if :You thought it made sense to hold one of our summer audits to visit your site. ( I am scheduling for late July and early August and I would be glad to include you. )Any questions arose regarding the the Pre-Audit letter Ben sent you .Let me know, I look forward to working with you. - Joe JunkerFYI I  will be traveling for the next week and a half so my response time might be slower but I am copying my management team on this email so they can get back to you sooner than me if you include them on the reply. ', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1556, 347, 2195, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-06-22', 'Pre-assessment call', NULL, NULL, 905),
(1557, 225, 2210, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-30', 'Joe- Here is the signed form. Ive attached a spreadsheet with account information regarding our electrical, natural gas, and water. Utility Representatives:         Tiffany Delgado Tiffany.Delgado@pgn.com         Michele Hodney mhodney@tualatin.gov         Amy L. Schulties Amy.Schulties@nwnatural.com         Katie Justin kjustin@gotoapp.com Ive also attached an NDA for the event. Can you and your team please sign this ASAP and send back to me for our records? Thank you! Have a great break and please let me know if you need anything else. ', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1558, 225, 2210, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-05', 'Thanks James,No problem on the NDA but we do have not  selected the team yet - we set the teams once we have locked in a date (it looks like August 2nd is the best for you). Will it work for me to sign and return one now? The remaining team member could sign it either when we get there, or as soon as we know who they are.  - Joe(Apologies for the delayed reply -  I was out of office and off line last week)_________________________James, Actually looking at our calendar, I wonder if any earlier dates (late July) might work for you to have us visit?  - Joe', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1559, 225, 2204, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-08', 'Hi Joseph, Thanks for following up, I did get back on Monday but am leaving for a business trip to the UK tomorrow.  In any case, weve discussed your offer a bit more and I learned that we have done some studies with the Energy Trust here and have some ongoing projects that were driven by those visits.  I would like to put this visit on the back burner for now  can we revisit it in 3 - 6 months? Wally', NULL, NULL, 909),
(1560, 225, 2204, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-09', 'Hi Wally,Sure that is fine. I will put a reminder on my calendar to follow-up. One thing to keep in mind is that Energy Trust is only able to help Northwest Natural commodity customers support on natural gas equipment. I do not know  you are a commodity or transport customer, but if it is the latter, we can fill in and help you with the thermal side.Much appreciated. - Joe', NULL, NULL, 909),
(1561, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-21', 'Joe,It would be great to have your group come by Im still waiting for an answer from our Portland office about the utility bill reviews I cant see any reason why they wouldnt want us to send you the information but its a formalityI look forward to meeting with youDave', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1562, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-06-26', 'Thanks David. I look forward to working with you. -Joe(Sorry for the delayed reply - I was traveling for a meeting late last week)', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1563, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-05', 'Hi David,I hope you had a good July 4th holiday. I thought I would check in, have you received any word from the Portland office? We are looking forward to working with you on an assessment.  I am hoping we might be able to arrange a site visit for later this month (July)Thanks - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1564, 225, 2208, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-05', 'Hi John, (Julie).Following up on voicemail I just left with John. Are you interested in having us hold one of our summer audits to visit your site for an assessment?.  I am going on the assumption that you are interested, but just busy. Let me know if not. I hope to to work with you.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 911);
INSERT INTO `ContactLog` (`ContactLogId`, `EmployeeId`, `PersonId`, `ContactTypeId`, `GrantId`, `TaskId`, `Date`, `Notes`, `LeadId`, `ProjectId`, `LocationId`) VALUES
(1565, 225, 2206, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-05', 'Hi Larry,I am following up on voicemail I just left.  Are you interested in having us hold one of our summer audits to visit your site for an assessment?  I am going on the assumption that you are interested, but just busy. Let me know if not. I hope to to work with you.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 912),
(1566, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-05', 'Hi Keith,I am just following up to see are interested in having us hold one of our summer time slots to visit one of your sites for an assessment. We have a couple more openings left and I would like to fit you into one of them. Let me know. I enjoyed getting to know you over lunch last month and would be glad to work with you on this. - Joe Junker(FYI: I tried to call you at 503.653.6300 but evidently you are at a different site. The gal that answered suggested I just send an email. )', NULL, NULL, 913),
(1567, 225, 2207, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-05', 'Good afternoon, Joe.  Thanks for being persistent; Ive been too slow in getting back to you. Ive copied Matt Turner and Ill be turning this over to him.  He and I discussed the energy efficiency assessment that you offer.  Matt has been involved in several similar efforts in the past, although we now have many more facilities. Matt, please keep me in the loop.  Id like to be informed just for my own education. Keith ChapmanSpecial Assistant to the EVPphone:  503.653.6300cell:  503.476.5016Vigor.net', NULL, NULL, 913),
(1568, 225, 2224, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-06', '(Keith Chapman also copied) Thanks Keith, Much appreciated.Matt,  Let me know if you have any questions on our process or the pre-audit letter I expect Keith forwarded to you. In terms of time line - we have an opening later this month and in August. I would be pleased to target a late July visit to your site if it works for you. - Joe  Junker___________________________________________Late July should work, please let me know what dates work for you and we can get something scheduled. We can discuss your process at that time. Matt TurnerGeneral Manager - Electricalphone  503-653-6300cell  360-798-6619______________________________________Excellent Matt, How about a day in the week of July 23rd? If all are the same to you, I propose visiting on Wednesday July 26.  Before that date we would like to collect preparatory information outlined in that pre-audit letter. It might also be helpful for us to have a brief conversation. Would you have 15 minutes available some time next week after Tuesday? ( I am out of office again between now and then).Let me knowThanks  - Joe Junker ', 190, NULL, 913),
(1569, 225, 2224, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-07-12', 'Several locations 2 in Oregon, 4-5 in Washington. (Vancouver, Clackamas, Swan Island, Seattle ....). Target 2 sites - Vancover and Clackamas Thinking it will be a month out. (Say early to Mid August). Most sites have already installed LEDs, VFD compressors, and efficient welders. Will talk to the site managers and get back to me. ', 190, NULL, 913),
(1570, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-12', 'On vacation until next Wed (7/19)', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1571, 225, 2216, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-13', 'Interested - too many projects between now and September. Lean operation. Will talk to John and get back to us. Likely not able to have us come until after September. ', NULL, NULL, 911),
(1572, 225, 2212, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-05-24', 'Hi Mark,Great talking to you today. I appreciate your interest in sharing information about our program. To that end, as agreed, I am attaching aPDF version of our brochure Sample report andCopy of the letter we send to clients when setting up an assessment. I am also pasting a boilerplate promotional email (below).  Let me know if any questions come to mind. I hope we get to work with you again soon. Thanks - Joe Junker____________________________Subject: No-cost full scope industrial energy and efficiency assessment: The Oregon State University Energy Efficiency Center (OSU EEC) offers no-cost full scope energy and efficiency assessments to industry. The center has provided over 650 of these to Northwest industries since 1986 and identified over $129 Million in cost savings and productivity opportunities. Based on follow up with assessed facilities, an average implemented savings of approximately $40,000 has been achieved.The assessment process entails a one day visit to your facility after collecting preliminary information. The team of analysts will tour your site, brainstorm on potential opportunities and devote the remainder of the day to collecting data that supports an analysis. Within a typical 60 days, a report is delivered with specific recommendations to reduce energy and waste streams costs and increase productivity and profitability. The OSU EEC has a full compliment of state of the art equipment to bring to bear on these assessments including combustion analyzers, thermal imaging cameras, a non-contact ultrasonic flow meter, specialized refrigeration system analysis tools, power quality analyzers, and a broad selection of data loggers. If you have any systems that might benefit from the evaluation these allow, the center can help. ', NULL, NULL, 916),
(1573, 225, 2212, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-13', 'Hi Mark,I just left you voice mail. We have two more industrial assessments to schedule this summer and I wondered if there might be one or two industrial customers of your client utilities that we could serve. I would be pleased to work with you.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 916),
(1574, 225, 2212, 3, 0, NULL, '2017-05-23', 'including, Blachly Lane Electric Cooperative, Canby Utility,Central Lincoln Peoples Utility District, City of Bandon, City of Cascade Locks, City of Drain, City of Monmouth Power and Light, Columbia Basin Electric Cooperative, Douglas Electric Cooperative, Hood River Electric Cooperative, McMinnville Water and Light, PNGC Power, West Oregon Electric Cooperative Inc, WASHINGTONPuget Sound Energy, Skamania County Public Utility District, Vera Water and Power, Avista', NULL, NULL, 916),
(1575, 360, 2202, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-07-13', 'Called Tim and asked if he knew anyone around the area that would be interested in an energy assessment. He said he would call around and either call me back directly or shoot me an email with the facility contact information. ', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1576, 225, 2231, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-13', 'Hi Richard,Hows things? Its been a busy summer here. With too much travel (work and family) for my taste.No that I am back I am working on scheduling out the rest of our summer. (A little behind the curve - I had two clients drop out due to issues at their faciliites). Anyways I wondered if ESI might have a client or two you would like to have us visit.Just checking - no worries if not.- Joe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1579, 225, 1127, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-14', 'Hi John,I recently saw that D.R. Johnson Lumber is providing the cross-laminated timber to a wooden high rise in Portland.It has been awhile since our 2011 energy and efficiency assessment of your facility and I wanted to see if you would be interested in an updated assessment. We have a few openings this summer and this fall and I would be pleased to visit you. There is still no cost to eligible facilities as the effort is paid for by the U.S.DOE. All it takes on your part is the time to host us.As a reminder: Oregon State University offers no-cost full scope energy and efficiency assessments to industry. The center has provided over 600 of these to Northwest industries since 1986 and identified over $129 Million in cost savings and productivity opportunities. Based on follow up with assessed facilities, an average implemented savings of approximately $40,000 has been achieved.The assessment process entails a one day visit to your facility after collecting preliminary information. The team of analysts tours your site, brainstorms on potential opportunities and devotes the remainder of the day to collecting data to support an analysis. Within a typical 60 days, a report is delivered with specific recommendations to reduce energy and waste streams costs and increase productivity and profitability. The OSU EEC has a full compliment of state of the art equipment to bring to bear on these assessments including combustion analyzers, thermal imaging cameras, a non-contact ultrasonic flow meter, specialized refrigeration system analysis tools, power quality analyzers, and a broad selection of data loggers. If you have any systems that might benefit from the evaluation these allow, the center can help. Let me know if you have an interest. I hope to get a chance to work with you.  I will follow up with a PDF copy of your last report and give you a call next week.  Thanks - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1581, 225, 355, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-14', 'Hi Kim,I am following up on voice mail I just left . It has been awhile since our 2009 energy and efficiency assessment of Franz Bakery Springfield.  I wanted to see if you would be interested in an updated assessment. We have a few openings this summer and this fall and I would be pleased to visit you. There is still no cost to eligible facilities as the effort is paid for by the U.S.DOE. All it takes on your part is the time to host us.As a reminder: Oregon State University offers no-cost full scope energy and efficiency assessments to industry. The center has provided over 600 of these to Northwest industries since 1986 and identified over $129 Million in cost savings and productivity opportunities. Based on follow up with assessed facilities, an average implemented savings of approximately $40,000 has been achieved.The assessment process entails a one day visit to your facility after collecting preliminary information. The team of analysts tours your site, brainstorms on potential opportunities and devotes the remainder of the day to collecting data to support an analysis. Within a typical 60 days, a report is delivered with specific recommendations to reduce energy and waste streams costs and increase productivity and profitability. The OSU EEC has a full compliment of state of the art equipment to bring to bear on these assessments including combustion analyzers, thermal imaging cameras, a non-contact ultrasonic flow meter, specialized refrigeration system analysis tools, power quality analyzers, and a broad selection of data loggers. If you have any systems that might benefit from the evaluation these allow, the center can help. Let me know if you have an interest. I hope to get a chance to work with you.  I will follow up with a PDF copy of your last report and give you a call next week.   Thanks - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 546),
(1582, 225, 1089, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-14', 'Joe,    We are interested in having this done again. We are just starting an addition to the bakery and will be very busy the rest of this year through the middle of next year. It would be great if we could be on your list to have an assessment done next year when we are not so busy, and we will have more equipment to assess. Thanks Kim ArnoldFranz Bakery (Springfield)2000 Nugget WayEugene, OR 97403541-485-8211 x1227', NULL, NULL, 546),
(1583, 225, 355, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-14', 'Kim, Glad to hear business is good enough to lead you to expanding. I will put you on our list to for an assessment next year (After January?) - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 546),
(1584, 225, 1101, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-14', 'Hi Greg,It has been awhile since our 2010 energy and efficiency assessment of Kerr Concentrates Inc.  I wanted to see if you would be interested in an updated assessment. We have a few openings this summer and this fall and I would be pleased to visit you. There is still no cost to eligible facilities as the effort is paid for by the U.S.DOE. All it takes on your part is the time to host us.As a reminder: Oregon State University offers no-cost full scope energy and efficiency assessments to industry. The center has provided over 600 of these to Northwest industries since 1986 and identified over $129 Million in cost savings and productivity opportunities. Based on follow up with assessed facilities, an average implemented savings of approximately $40,000 has been achieved.The assessment process entails a one day visit to your facility after collecting preliminary information. The team of analysts tours your site, brainstorms on potential opportunities and devotes the remainder of the day to collecting data to support an analysis. Within a typical 60 days, a report is delivered with specific recommendations to reduce energy and waste streams costs and increase productivity and profitability. The OSU EEC has a full compliment of state of the art equipment to bring to bear on these assessments including combustion analyzers, thermal imaging cameras, a non-contact ultrasonic flow meter, specialized refrigeration system analysis tools, power quality analyzers, and a broad selection of data loggers. If you have any systems that might benefit from the evaluation these allow, the center can help. Let me know if you have an interest. I hope to get a chance to work with you.  I will follow up with a PDF copy of your last report and give you a call next week.  Thanks - Joe Junker(If you would like to find out more before contacting me check our website at  http://eec.oregonstate.edu/) ', 197, NULL, NULL),
(1587, 225, 1101, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-19', 'Good morning, Joe Greg Watkins Kerr Concentrates, Say I appreciate your call and your emails and the opportunity once again for you guys to work with Kerr concentrates. We had a meeting yesterday to discuss with the group and yes we are excited lets have you guys back out to take a look at our facility in an assessment.If you can that give me a call back. I am going to be out of the office pretty much the rest of the the afternoon I know it is only 830 AM that started real early today in fact I will be starting early the next few days so I will be in and out of the office today tomorrow quite a bit. I am on vacation from Friday until Tuesday of next week I will be back in the office Wednesday -- If I dont talk to you before next Wednesday I will give you a call back when I get back in the office.Sorry for a long winded message but once again would love to have you guys in, and hopefully we can talk within the next week about that and get things arranged. You have a great day - talk to you later bye.', 197, NULL, NULL),
(1588, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-19', 'Left message with someone that answered.', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1589, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-20', 'Hi David - I called and left a message for you yesterday. Are you interested in having us hold one of our summer audits to visit your site for an assessment?. I have been going on the assumption that you are interested, but just busy. Let me know if not. I hope to to work with you.- Joe Junker', 187, NULL, 911),
(1590, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-20', 'Joe,Thanks for getting back with me. Im still trying to gather all the utility usage information for you, but I am definitely still wanting you to come out for an audit. Im sure you can save us tons. The guys in Portland are still dragging their feet and have yet to give me an answer.Cheers!Dave', NULL, NULL, 364),
