(1604, 225, 1101, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-07-26', 'Hi Greg,I just left you voice mail. I expect you could be pretty busy on your first day back from a break, but if you have time to give me a call, that would be great.Thanks - Joe Junker', 197, NULL, 557),
(1605, 368, 2158, 2, 0, -1, '2017-07-24', 'Implementation - Art Little is supposed to get me in contact with Steve Nelson (plant engineer) who should know more about the report and the recommendations inside.', NULL, 848, 882),
(1606, 225, 1101, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-19', 'Hi Greg,I am following up on our traded voice mails today. I am pleased you are interested and look forward to fielding a team to visit Kerr Concentrates Inc and perform an assessment.I hope we can connect before you take off for vacation, but if not I will anticipate talking to you when you get back next Wednesday.  In the mean time, as I suggested, I am attaching a letter that outlines our assessment process and what we work to collect to best prepare for an assessment. The key items we ask you to return so we can get going on our pre-visit analysis are the:Industrial Pre-Assessment Form (that includes eligibility and logistic information)Utility Release (so we can collect a one year month-to-month profile of your energy use and utility expenses) The letter also includes a list of additional helpful preparatory information. While they are not required, they are very helpful and can greatly improve the job we are able to do for you. I look forward to speaking with you. Thanks!-Joe Junker.', 197, NULL, 557),
(1608, 225, 2233, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-07-26', 'Kelly Called in followup to email from David Harris at SUB. I followed up to the call - sending the preaudit doc.Kelly is the lead planner and (lead?) on sustainability team. Graduated with Masters from OSU in 2016. They installed Dent data loggers to study their demand. Found it peaks in the evening 10 PM to 6 AM. Getting ready to purchase 5 electric buses, with 5 more in following year. Will be 10% of fleet.  Site has a maintenance building and admin building. Suggest we get SUB electrician to work with theirs on audit as each has access to some points in the facility. ', 201, NULL, 921),
(1609, 367, 2201, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-07-27', 'Spoke with David over the phone. He explained that the Portland office is \"ignoring\" his communications. He also told me that the Portland office recently expressed interests in reducing company-wide costs by half a million dollars, which I explained is something our assessment would definitely help with. When asked about the best date for an assessment he said the beginning of September will work best because the eclipse will have Newport locked up and will be difficult for his facility to export their products. I will call back in two weeks and email in a week.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1610, 367, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-27', 'Good morning David, This is Joe Lewis from the Energy Efficiency Center. We just spoke on the phone and I wanted to send an email recapping our conversation. You are still waiting on word from the Portland office about your utility bills and will try to get us some information from your billing department to move the pre-assessment package forward.We also discussed the best time to schedule an assessment. You expressed concerns that the eclipse will have Newport locked up and will backup your facility late into August. Therefore, the first week of September appears to be the best time to plan an assessment. Please let me know if any of the above details are incorrect and if there are any questions that I could clear up for you.Thank you for your time and I look forward to working with you! Joe Lewis', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1611, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-27', 'David, Joe,  Would it work to target August 31? I only ask because I was holding a spot for David in this fiscal year and thats the last day.  Joe____I think that any time during the week of August 28th would be as good as any other. If I cant get Portland to respond by next week, Im going to give up and assume they dont care. Cheers! Dave_____Great!, Sounds like a plan.  Joe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1612, 225, 1101, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-28', 'Connected after a few tries. Wednesdays are best. Currently targeting August 16th. If not then, the 23rd or 30th.', NULL, NULL, 557),
(1613, 359, 2209, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-07-26', 'Followed up on the missing datalogger (still stuck in their shipping facility) and the unanswered questions (claimed did not see my previous emails about additional questions, and asked to forward those questions again).', NULL, NULL, 914),
(1614, 359, 2209, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-07-31', 'Called to follow up on missing datalogger (Is being shipped right now through UPS) and additional questions (said he will email me with all the answers to the questions through email along with the tracking number of the datalogger). ', NULL, NULL, 914),
