(1618, 225, 2233, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-02', 'Hi Kelly, Just- Following up on our conversation. Sounds like you have to push this to after October 1st.  That is fine. I will give you a call to lock in the details when I return from my trip to Nelson BC, and you are back from your holiday. I put a reminder on my calendar for August 15.Talk you you then.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 921),
(1619, 225, 2201, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-02', 'David,After talking to my team, we are able to field a team to visit you on any day you like Monday - Thursday in the week of August 28th. I propose we set our visit for Wednesday 8/30 but let me know if you prefer a different day.In the mean time we will be looking for the pre-audit letter information so we can start preparing. As I mentioned previously, I will be out through next week, so if you copy everyone on this email (my management team and Joseph Lewis - email bellow too) when you send it, they can get the team going on the preparatory analysis.Thanks - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 364),
(1620, 225, 1101, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-02', 'Hi Greg,I wanted to touch base before heading out on holiday.  Based on our conversation Monday we are currently planning to visit you on Wednesday, August 16. (With alternative dates of the or 23 or 30th - but the sooner the better for us). My team will be watching for information requested in the pre-audit letter I sent so they can start preparing.  Joseph Lewis (copied here) will be following up with you on that and It would be great if you could copy him and my management team when you send that so they can get going right away. (They are copied on this and their emails are listed below)Much appreciated - looking forward to the assessment - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 557),
(1621, 367, 1101, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-04', 'Left voicemail introducing myself and requesting a call back to confirm assessment date', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1622, 367, 1101, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-04', 'Greg,My name is Joe Lewis and I am an Energy Analyst at Oregon States Energy Efficiency Center.You have spoken with the Director of the Center, Joe Junker, and planned on having us out for as assessment on Wednesday, August 16th. Because he is out on holiday I am following up with you about this assessment.I left you a voicemail this morning about our possible assessment dates. If you get the chance today, feel free to call me back so we can lock in your assessment date.Thank you for your time and I look forward to working with you.Joe Lewis', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1623, 367, 1000, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-04', 'Discussed potential for an assessment. He explained they may be more interested in 9-12 months', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1624, 367, 2235, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-04', 'Spoke about potential assessment. She has to run it past owners first. Will call again late next week', 202, NULL, NULL),
(1625, 367, 2235, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-04', 'Hello Tammy,My name is Joe Lewis with Oregon States Energy Efficiency Center and we just spoke on the phone in regards to a potential energy assessment for your facility.I will plan on calling you Friday morning to check in on your owners status.If you hear from them before Friday, feel free to contact me either by email or phone.Thank you for your time and I look forward to working with you!Joe Lewis', 202, NULL, NULL),
(1626, 367, 2237, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-08', 'Hello Patrick and Shawn,My name is Joe Lewis and I am an Energy Analyst with Oregon States Energy Efficiency Center (EEC).The EEC provides no-cost energy audits for manufacturing and fabrication facilities.Matt Turner informed me that your facility may be interested in an energy assessment in the near future.We would like to schedule an assessment during the month of August because it is most advantageous for our assessment teams and report generation schedule. However we can examine other timelines if August will not work for you.I would normally begin this line of conversation with a phone call, however I was not provided your phone numbers. If this assessment is something you believe your facility will benefit from, please feel free to call me at (503) 547-5234, or send me your phone number and a time that works to discuss the assessment.Thank you for your time and I am looking forward to the opportunity to work with both of you.Joe Lewis', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1627, 367, 2236, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-08', 'Hello Patrick and Shawn,My name is Joe Lewis and I am an Energy Analyst with Oregon States Energy Efficiency Center (EEC).The EEC provides no-cost energy audits for manufacturing and fabrication facilities.Matt Turner informed me that your facility may be interested in an energy assessment in the near future.We would like to schedule an assessment during the month of August because it is most advantageous for our assessment teams and report generation schedule. However we can examine other timelines if August will not work for you.I would normally begin this line of conversation with a phone call, however I was not provided your phone numbers. If this assessment is something you believe your facility will benefit from, please feel free to call me at (503) 547-5234, or send me your phone number and a time that works to discuss the assessment.Thank you for your time and I am looking forward to the opportunity to work with both of you.Joe Lewis', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1628, 367, 1101, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-07', 'Spoke with Greg, confirmed Aug 16th assessment date, awaiting call from utilities manager', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1629, 367, 2201, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-08', 'Left a message with receptionist and asked for david to call back to discuss the pre assessment package', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1630, 367, 2238, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-08', 'Left initial contact voicemail', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1631, 367, 2238, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-08', 'Roni,My name is Joe Lewis and I am an Energy Analyst at Oregon States Energy Efficiency Center.I left you a voicemail today about possibly coming out for an energy assessment of your facility sometime this month, or later this year. When you get the chance, feel free to call me at (503) 547-5234 to discuss a potential assessment.Thank you for your time and I look forward to the opportunity of working with you.Joe Lewis', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1632, 367, 2239, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-08', 'Spoke with Pat and confirmed assessment date of 8/23. Will send PAP tomorrow', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1633, 367, 2239, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-09', 'Pat,I hope this is the correct email, as I found it online. I tried to contact you on the phone but had difficulty getting through to you.We spoke yesterday about setting up an energy assessment for your facility on August 23.Attached you will find the Pre-Assessment Package I explained to you yesterday. Please scan and return pages 3 and 4 filled out at your earliest convenience.We are very much looking forward to working with you. Please call me at (503) 547-5234 if you have any questions or issues.Thank you,Joe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1634, 367, 2239, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-09', 'Hi Joseph, Ill get to work on this. Pat Lamb 541-222-1032', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1635, 367, 2236, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-09', 'Patrick expressed interest in an assessment. We scheduled for Sep 26th. the PAP was sent', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1636, 367, 2237, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-14', 'Received PAP today, assessment scheduled for 9/26', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1637, 225, 2210, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-18', 'Joe- Good morning. I am emailing to let you know that our leadership has asked me to put a hold on proceeding with the assessment. You may have heard that our owner recently sold the company to Campbells Soup. Given that it will take some months to finalize the deal and there is still a good deal of uncertainty regarding changes moving forward, our leadership is putting a hold on some of our higher engagement commitments. We are still interested in participating in the assessment just not at this time. Im sorry if this has caused any trouble on your end and I hope you understand our extraordinary circumstances. Please let me know if you have any questions. Thanks. ', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1638, 225, 2210, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-18', 'Thanks John,It is a disappointment to be sure, but  I understand.  I hope we will get an opportunity to work with you next year once this transition sorts out. Best of luck.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 106),
(1639, 367, 2239, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-15', 'Called and left a voice mail to get the PAP authorized', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1640, 367, 2235, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-15', 'Left a voicemail to discuss a potential assessment', 202, NULL, NULL),
(1641, 367, 2235, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-15', 'Tammy,We spoke early last week about a potential energy assessment of your facility.You informed me that you had to speak with the owners to gauge their willingness to let us tour the facility.I left you a message earlier today to check in on their response. Please give me a call back at (503) 547-5234 at your earliest convenience.Thank you and have a nice day,Joe', 202, NULL, NULL),
(1642, 367, 2238, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-18', 'Called to get PAP done. Forwarded to Tamara who will get it done today.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1643, 225, 370, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-07-14', 'Hi Mark, Dean, It has been awhile since our 2010 energy and efficiency assessment of NORPAC Foods, Inc.  I wanted to see if you would be interested in an updated assessment. We have a few openings this summer and this fall and I would be pleased to visit you. There is still no cost to eligible facilities as the effort is paid for by the U.S.DOE. All it takes on your part is the time to host us. ......Let me know if you have an interest. I hope to get a chance to work with you.  I will follow up with a PDF copy of your last report and give you a call next week.   Thanks - Joe Junker ', NULL, NULL, 565),
(1644, 225, 2241, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-21', 'Joe I apologize for responding so late. At this time we are right in the middle of our processing and some significant management changes going on within the company. We are implementing a new ERP system for the company over the next 8 months which has me involved in outside training half the week. We have been successful with our energy improvements and efficiencies last year and so far this year. I appreciate the offer but at this time feel we are doing a very good job. I would possibly be interested in the future but this season is not a time I need to add more on. Thanks I will look over the previous assessment for possibly interest in the future.  ', NULL, NULL, 565),
(1645, 225, 2241, 1, 0, NULL, '2017-08-22', 'Lawrence,Thanks for the update. Sounds like you are in the middle of an improvement push. Glad to hear it. I expect it will yield great benefit. Please do give thought to having us visit some time in the future when you do not have some much on your plate. Best of luck!- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 565),
(1646, 225, 2233, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-08-31', 'Following up. Would you like to schedule a visit for early October - say a day in the week of October 9th or 16th?', NULL, NULL, 921),
(1647, 367, 2242, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-09-07', 'left voicemail and followup email', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1648, 367, 2242, 3, 0, NULL, '2017-09-07', 'Jim,My name is Joe Lewis with Oregon States Energy Efficiency Center. I just left you a voicemail and wanted to followup to make sure we get in touch.Tim Gardner with Bergstrom Nutrition referred us to you.We provide no cost energy audits for small to medium manufactures through a grant with the Department of Energy. We assess potential savings in productivity, energy consumption, and cost savings.When you get the chance, please call me back at (503) 547-5234 to discuss the potential assessments.Thank you for your time and I look forward to working with you.Joe', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1649, 367, 2242, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-09-08', 'Received call back out of office and returned in first thing the next day. No answer, left voicemail.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1650, 367, 2242, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-09-11', 'Spoke with Jim over phone. He owns three companies, including Bergstrom, and has forwarded my email and contact info to the contacts of his other two companies. Bend location seemed most interested. Should hear back in next week or two.', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(1651, 367, 2204, 2, 0, NULL, '2017-09-13', 'Called and got in contact. He was in a meeting and will return the call later this afternoon.', NULL, NULL, 909),
