(1705, 225, 2266, 1, 0, NULL, '2018-02-27', 'Spoke to receptionist. He had to go home for a family emergency. Suggests I send an email. ', NULL, NULL, 936),
(1706, 225, 2266, 1, 0, NULL, '2018-02-27', 'Hi Jim, I just called to see if you might like hear more about our program an consider setting up an assessment. The person I spoke to suggested I send you an email. Hope all is well. I will try to follow up again later this week if I do not hear from you.- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 936),
