(1724, 367, 2216, 1, 0, NULL, '2018-05-01', 'Julie,This is Joe Lewis with Oregon State Universitys Energy Efficiency Center.I am emailing you about the voicemail I just left you.We spoke late last year about setting up a no cost energy assessment at your facility and you had mentioned that the summer of 2018 would be the best time to schedule an assessment. With the summer only a few months away, we wanted to touch base and gauge your interest in an audit potentially in late June.We are wrapping up our schedule for this year and would like to include your facility if this is something you are still interested in.Please feel free to get in touch with me at (503) 547-5234 or at this email address if you have any questions or would like to move forward in the assessment process.Thank you and have a great day!Joe', NULL, NULL, 911),
