(1739, 225, 2291, 1, 0, NULL, '2018-06-07', 'LVM and EM in followup to intro by Tom Simpson NWNG:Thanks for the introduction Tom.Hello Willy, (I just left you voicemail). I will be glad to work with you to set up an assessment.  Is there a good time to call?FYI: We currently have permission from U.S.DOE to work with one facility. It sounds like the Providence St Vincent Medical Center would be the place to start. We can ask U.S.DOE for permission to serve the other once we serve the first. - Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 939),
(1740, 225, 2292, 1, 0, NULL, '2018-05-23', 'Thank you Richard, Jody Eric Our no-cost full scope energy and efficiency assessments typically entail a one day site visit by 4-5 student analysts and faculty mentor after collecting preliminary information. The team will tour your site, brainstorm on potential opportunities and devote the remainder of the day to collecting data that supports an analysis. - snip -I would be glad to call at a time and number that works for you to answer any questions, or you can contact me  at  - snip -- Joe Junker', NULL, NULL, 940),
