(1763, 225, 2308, 1, 0, NULL, '2018-07-02', 'Stein, Grant D. Grant.Stein@gapac.com via oregonstate.edu Mon, Jul 2, 8:58 AM (3 days ago)to Joseph, AlanHi Joe, Alan Fraser (Energy Smart Industrial; ccd) passed along your information to me regarding an opportunity for the EEC to come out and audit one of our energy systems. We are very interested in pursuing this opportunity. A few years ago, the Georgia-Pacific Toledo containerboard mill started developing plans to upgrade our wastewater treatment system to reduce solids accumulation and energy demand via more efficient aerators; this project became lost in the weeds with too many diverse aeration options. I have recently taken on the role of Energy Leader and would like to reawaken this project. I think this assessment by the EEC would be an excellent way to kick it off. Please let me know what would be needed from our end to set up the assessment with the EEC team. I look forward to working with you. Best,Grant Grant SteinProcess Engineer | Georgia-Pacific ToledoMobile: (541) 272-4048Office: (541) 336-8278Grant.Stein@gapac.com', NULL, NULL, 944),
