(656, 5, 2, 3, 634, 'Cristom Vineyards', 'RP0033', '2012-02-17', '2012-04-17', 150, 0, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table border=\"0\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Phone Walkthrough Notes</span></p>\n<p>Propane used for forklifts and Propane Powered air cannons to scare birds</p>\n<p>Electricity<br />3 Meters - 1. Winery<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. Viticulture Shop<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3. PumpHouse&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Pumphous</strong><strong>e</strong></p>\n<p>Water pumped to irrigation - 3 4,000 gallon holding tanks&nbsp;<br />Metered flow - rate of flow + depletion<br />Overflow continously - No shutoff</p>\n<p><strong>Viticulture</strong><br />Kitchen, Hot Water Heaters, Repair Shop, Charging Power Tools, Lights</p>\n<p>2 seperate refrigeration glycol systems<br />1 stationary outside - bought used `94 - inefficient&nbsp;<br />1 mobile inside - new and effficient</p>\n<p>Air Compressor</p>\n<p>3 Pumps, 2 electric, 1 on compressed air</p>\n<p>2 separate hot water heaters and tanks<br />1 old - ineffective only produces lukewarm<br />1 new efficient and effective&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>2 Presses</p>\n<p>Bottling Line - 8 hours/day - 4 weeks a year</p>\n<p>Tasting Room - Replica Light fixtures inefficient</p>\n<p>Humidifier in Cellar to maintatin humidity at 60%</p>\n<p>Cellar lights efficient flourescents</p>\n<p>Plans for remodelling/additions<br />&nbsp;- Windows and Day Lighting<br />&nbsp;- Insulation - \"Stow-Therm\"<br />Cellar needs to be 55-65 degrees year round, insulate better</p>\n<p>HUGELY Interested in Solar Power - Cost effective now?<br />Rain water capture for clean-up</p>\n<p>Water is a big deal<br />How to handle waste water/grey water<br />&nbsp;- down drain now, would like to pump to irrigate landscape</p>\n<p>Cell:503-689-4477&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', NULL),
