(385, 5866, 4, 'Dewatering Pump Peak Demand Reduction', NULL, '2.3131.2', 0, 20700, 20700, 35800, 'Install demand controller to temporarily cycle off 3 400 hp dewatering pumps to reduce demand peak by 800 kW.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 20700, 35800, '2003-01-01', 0, 'Frank Carr prefers manual control. turn off when ahead of goals.  Thinks saving at least $100k/yr. at no imp cost.  Rec savings more conservative', 1, 0, NULL),
