(405, 5886, 3, 'Combine Compressed Air Systems', NULL, '2.4226.2', 0, 3240, 3240, 6988, 'After fixing leaks. combine planer and stud mill systems and turn off 100 hp QNW compressor. run plant with 75 hp QNW at higher capacity.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 3240, 6988, '2002-08-01', 0, 'Did not connect mills. but added 7.5 hp recip to old mill. and turned off 100 hp', 1, 0, NULL),
