(543, 6088, 5, 'Premium Efficiency Motors', NULL, '2.4111.2', 0, 4986, 4986, 1846, 'Replace 27 current motors with premium efficiency models to save energy.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 4986, 1846, '2001-10-01', 0, 'Swtiched motor supplier from Siemens to Reliance. which has better selection of premium motors.  Currently replace < 30 hp. will consider replacing larger based on our report when they fail.', 1, 0, NULL),
