(545, 6090, 2, 'Hire Reheologist', NULL, '3.1161.1', 0, 662000, 662000, 1120240, 'Hire a rheologist to fix problems with injection modling line molds that require painting step to hide.  Tested to rule out filler content and transition temperature at regrind boundaries.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 662000, 1120240, '0000-00-00', 21, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(546, 6091, 3, 'Fix Leaks. North Plant', NULL, '2.4235.2', 0, 1500, 1500, 1734, 'Fix north plant air leaks.  2 100 hp compressors @ 110>20% leaks.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1500, 1734, '0000-00-00', 21, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(547, 6092, 4, 'Downsize North Plant Compressors', NULL, '2.4226.2', 0, 17800, 17800, 13247, 'Downsize compressor to save energy.  100 hp throttle @ 25%C > 50 hp L-UL', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 17800, 13247, '0000-00-00', 21, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(548, 6093, 5, 'Premium Efficiency Motors', NULL, '2.4133.2', 0, 4348, 4348, 2286, 'Replace 108 motors with premium efficiency models instead of rewinding', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 4348, 2286, '0000-00-00', 21, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(549, 6094, 1, 'Power Plant Emissions', NULL, '2.3323.3', 0, 5833000, 5833000, 6372000, 'Operation of the power plant during the winter months has not been allowed due to state air quality regulations.  As a result. electricity must be purchased at a rate of $25/MWh.  Adding dry-lime scrubbing to control sulfur dioxide stack-gas emissions will allow for winter operations. reducing the unit energy cost by approximately 50%.  For this recommendation. we will only investigate the benefits of retrofitting the #4 boiler. although the same technology can be applied to the remaining boilers.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 5833000, 6372000, '0000-00-00', 22, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(550, 6095, 2, 'Acid Plant Compressors', NULL, '213211', 0, 536756, 536756, 2259300, 'Two steam turbines operate the main compressors at the acid plant.  The steam turbines are run by high pressure steam. generated by the auxiliary. Holman. and waste heat boilers.  Currently the main use for high pressure steam is the steam turbines.  Installing two 4.000 horsepower motors to replace the steam turbine generators will save 36% of the natural gas cost in the smelting plant.  The auxiliary boiler will need to be used for starting up the acid plant steam system. but the natural gas cost should be minor.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 536756, 2259300, '0000-00-00', 1, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(551, 6096, 3, 'Matte Grinding Heat Exchanger', NULL, '211241', 0, 144600, 144600, 96000, 'A natural gas burner is used to heat air for the matte grinding mill to 350?F.  Installing a heat exchanger to transfer heat from the waste heat boiler steam to the matte heating air will eliminate natural gas use of this burner.  This will result in an 11% decrease in smelter natural gas cost.  A new high pressure steam turbine should installed in the turbine generator to maintain electricity production.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 144600, 96000, '0000-00-00', 22, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(552, 6097, 4, 'Fix Air Leaks', NULL, '242362', 0, 7500, 7500, 7400, 'Compressing air is inefficient. with as much as 90% of compressor power dissipated as waste heat.  Therefore. leaks can be expensive.  Eliminating all leaks in a complex distribution system is unrealistic.  However. proper preventive maintenance can minimize the expense associated with leaks.  Fixing the leaks in your system will save more than 230 MW of energy.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 7500, 7400, '2002-01-01', 0, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(553, 6098, 5, 'Furnace Distribution Air System', NULL, '242321', 0, 58600, 58600, 137600, 'Dispensing the concentrate feed at the Flash Smelter Furnace (FSF) burner and matte in the Flash Converting Furnace (FCF) burner is aided by low-pressure. high-volume compressed air.  The air used in this process is produced by letting-down high-pressure compressed air from 90 psig to approximately 15 psig.  Replacing this compressed air use with two low-pressure blowers will reduce smelter compressed air system demand more than 20%.  The resulting reduction in airflow will allow one compressor to be turned off.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 58600, 137600, '0000-00-00', 22, '', 1, 0, NULL),
(554, 6099, 1, 'Reduce Inventory', NULL, '4.3210.4', 0, 79300, 79300, 324000, 'Have $6M WIP.  80% of JIT companies reduce inv 33%. for $2M reduction @ 15% carry cost. Suggest kanban  pull system.  IC=consultant+layout changes+workforce training.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 79300, 324000, '2002-08-01', 0, 'President agreed to work on reducing inventory.  Estimates reduced by 15-20%. take ~50% of recommended 33% reduction', 1, 0, NULL),
(555, 6100, 2, 'Pallet Recycling', NULL, '3.5316.4', 0, 0, 0, 2300, 'Stack pallets for wood pallet recycler to pick up.  Save $3.800 disposal - labor cost.Contract with Weyerhauser to take cardboard. paper and all pallet.  The pay labor as recommended to stack pallets. but save disposal cost.  Cardboard and paper recycling = bonus.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 2300, '2001-08-01', 0, '', 1, 0, NULL),
