(1447, 6928, 6, 'Mobilize Trim Tables', NULL, '442301', 0, 11600, 11600, 97200, 'Mobilize 3 trimming tables in the filleting area to reduce material handling.  Wheels allow aligning trim tables to optimum config. while conveyor saves handling and forklift labor.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, '0000-00-00', 13, 'Mobility require ceiling electrical drops. possible but more maintenance.', 1, 0, NULL),
