(1450, 6931, 9, 'Improve Waste Water Drain System', NULL, '46520', 0, 69000, 69000, 310000, 'Undersize Waste Water drain Pipe allows drain to ocean to back up and shut down production ~2 weeks/yr.  Rec 9\' >12\' cast iron pipe.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, '2000-07-01', 0, 'Modified outlet from rotating screens from \'Y\' to separate pipes with storage to increase pressure and cleaned drains.', 1, 0, NULL),
