(3852, 8998, 1, 'Notched V-Belt', NULL, '24111', 0, 0, 0, 198, 'Replace standard V-belts on belt-driven motors with higher efficiency. notched V-belts as they\r wear out. The use of notched belts has been demonstrated to reduce motor energy use by 2%\r through improvements in belt efficiency due to changes in friction. bending. and slip.', 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, NULL),
