(4170, 9829, 4, 'Reduce Refrig. Discharge Pressure', 283, '2.2621', 2, 0, 0, 1409, 'Adjust the refrigeration defrost cycle to minimize the continuous time spent defrosting allowing for reduced discharge pressures. For the purpose of this analysis, a 25% annual reduction in defrost time was assumed. We believe this is a reasonable estimate for reduced defrost time, but have also included a table summarizing energy savings for different percentages. Reducing continuous annual defrost time by 25% will decrease refrigeration system energy cost by 2%', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1409, '2013-03-01', 0, 'Did change set points. Head pressure reduced.', 1, 0, 18),
