(4173, 9830, 3, 'Retrofit Refrigerated Trucks', 311, '2.7232', 3, 2500, 0, 1422, 'Retrofit the existing refrigeration units on refrigerated trucks with electric motors. This will allow the refrigeration units to run on electricity when the trucks are stationary at the docks, reducing the facility\\\'s diesel use and ultimately reducing the energy required to maintain refrigerated temperatures by 55%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1422, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Definitely on our radar. Want to do eventually. ', 1, 0, 4),
(4174, 9831, 5, 'Photovoltaic Array', 323, '2.9114', 3, 35404, 17576, 1964, 'Install a photovoltaic array on the building roof. This will provide an alternative source for 1% of the facility\\\'s energy consumption and reduce carbon dioxide emissions associated with electrical generation.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 17576, 1964, '0000-00-00', 2, 'No plans in place. Looking at idea of doing it in Sacramento', 1, 0, 10),
