(4176, 9833, 2, 'Box Erector', 325, '4.441', 4, 73231, 0, 35308, 'Install a box erector and standardize boxes to work with the erector. A box erector will decrease the hours of labor needed to construct boxes and result in an 88% reduction in labor cost that can be redirected elsewhere.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 35308, '2015-06-01', 0, 'Will - eventually not sure when. Likely next year. ', 1, 0, 4),
