(4184, 9799, 1, 'Increase Suction Pressure', 321, '2.262', 2, 0, 0, 941, 'Adjust suction pressure set points from 58 psig (41 Â°F) to 75 psig (44.3 Â°F) on the refrigeration system during the non-harvest season. This will increase system efficiency, decreasing compressor energy consumption by 53%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 6),
