(4188, 9872, 3, 'Turn Off Lights', 0, '2.7124', 1, 538, 538, 1165, 'Turn the lights off when they are not in use. To reduce light startup time, replace the HPS lamps in the blower room highbay, the engine room, and the basement of the sludge handling. Replace with efficient 8 foot and 4 foot fluorescent lamps. This will qualify for the BPA ESP Incentive.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 538, 1165, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 5),
