(4201, 9903, 2, 'Reduce Compressed Air Pressure', 323, '2.4231', 2, 500, 500, 1704, 'Reduce compressed air system pressure from 120 psig to 100 psig in the main facility. Maintaining a pressure greater than that required by the system provides little added benefit. Reducing pressure will decrease associated compressor annual energy costs by 19%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 500, 1704, '2014-02-06', 0, 'Dropped to 100 PSI, had some troubles. This cylinder had 5 in bore 1\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"stroke. Alumiinum was deforming. Put in cast iron. Expect to turn down.', 1, 0, 15),
