(4622, 11424, 1, 'Install CO2 Recovery', 321, '3.5312', 2, 72500, 72500, 45760, 'Install a carbon dioxide (CO2) recovery system on the fermenters. This will capture and bottle pure carbon dioxide for reuse, saving on gas purchase costs. This will reduce the amount of CO2 the facility buys, reducing associated gas purchases by 88.9%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 72500, 45760, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 3),
