(4625, 11443, 4, 'Install Dedicated Air Compressor', 335, '2.4226', 2, 4920, 0, 7929, 'Install a dedicated air compressor for the dry fire sprinkler system to eliminate the operating hours of the 300 hp compressor on Sundays. This will reduce associated annual energy consumption  by 1%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 7929, '0000-00-00', 6, 'The facility had issues with their compressor and had to replace it. The contact was not aware if the dedicated compressor had been installed and will send a follow up email for analysts.', 1, 0, 4),
(4626, 11444, 1, 'Upgrade Air Compressor Controls', 310, '2.4224', 2, 4630, 0, 107219, 'Convert the VFD controlled compressor to analog signal control and implement a VFD trim sequencing strategy to control the load on each compressor. These actions will reduce associated annual energy use by 87%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 107219, '0000-00-00', 6, 'The facility had issues with their compressor and had to replace it. The contact was not aware if the controls strategy had been updated and will send a follow up email for analysts.', 1, 0, 8),
