(4628, 11448, 3, 'Insulate Condensate Return Pipe', 340, '2.2511', 2, 1771, 0, 2456, 'Insulate 50 feet of condensate return piping, a pipe fitting located behind the glue manufacturing site, and the deaerator tank found next to the boiler with a fiberglass all service jacket. This will reduce heat loss from hot surfaces, lowering annual energy consumption by 3% per year.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2456, '0000-00-00', 22, 'The contact will need to check with his maintenance crew to confirm if this has been done. Contact will follow up with analysts in an email.', 1, 0, 12),
(4629, 11449, 2, 'Control Humidity in Facility', 330, '4.122', 3, 132903, 132903, 392710, 'Control the humidity in the facility by installing high speed doors, ducting air from dust collection systems back into the building and maintaining the facility near 50Â°F. This will allow the facility to keep the relative humidity between 65-75% and increase production by 1.73%', 0, 0, 0, 0, 132903, 392710, '0000-00-00', 11, 'Contact received quotes for high speed doors (which will be sent to analysts) and needs approval for executives to continue. Contact feels that after one more winter of results showing the trend that he will get approval to continue with it in Spring 2016.\n\nAnalysts will follow up on this recommendation in the Spring of 2017 to see if it was implemented and the results of the implementation.', 1, 0, 7),
(4630, 11514, 1, 'Upgrade Air Compressor Controls', 321, '2.4224', 2, 87114, 87114, 102712, 'Install VFD controls on Air Compressor 3 and implement a VFD trim sequencing strategy to control the load on all compressors. These actions will reduce associated annual energy use by 32%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 87114, 102712, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility plans to upgrade compressed air controls and is looking into it now.', 1, 0, 10),
(4631, 11515, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 4000, 0, 6000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4632, 11516, 6, 'Reduce Idle Time', 321, '2.4112', 1, 43000, 0, 22225, 'Automate all chain and conveyor lines to operate only when loaded. This will save on conveyor motor energy, and eliminate unneccesary use, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 30.0%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 22225, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 4),
(4633, 11517, 2, 'Install Notched V-Belt', 330, '2.4111', 2, 0, 0, 6951, 'Upgrade all belt driven motors to notched V-belts. The use of notched v-belts will reduce motor energy use by 2.1% on average through improved transmission efficiency. This is achieved by reducing losses due to bending, friction, slip between the belt and the sheave, and stretching of the belt over time.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 6951, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 5),
(4634, 11518, 4, 'Reduce Chipper Idle Time', 335, '2.6218', 1, 1502, 1502, 4747, 'Reduce idle time of the two 700 hp DC motors for the chipper. This will save energy, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 90,067 kWh.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1502, 4747, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 3),
(4635, 11519, 3, 'Install Efficient Lighting', 0, '2.7143', 3, 499903, 258445, 101299, 'Install more efficient LED fixtures with distributed control technology throughout the facility. This will increase lighting efficiency and reduce operation hours, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 80%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 258445, 101299, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 37),
(4636, 11520, 3, 'Install Premium Plus Motors', 334, '2.4133', 1, 3941, 0, 2677, 'Incrementally install NEMA premium plus motors in place of the current influent pump, W3 pump, and aerator motors. This will increase the average full-load efficiency of the motors from 89% to 96%, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 3%.', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 2677, '0000-00-00', 14, 'no one is assigned to do the implenentation', 1, 0, 7),
(4637, 11521, 1, 'Upgrade Aeration Motor Controls', 334, '2.4144', 2, 1500, 0, 11883, 'Program set-point controls on oxidation ditch motors #1, #2, and #3. Integrate VFD controls on motor #4 and the set-point controls for the other oxidation ditch motors into the Supervisory Control and Data Acquisition (SCADA) system to vary motor speed based on dissolved oxygen (DO) concentrations. Operating the two-speed motors at low speed when DO concentration is above the target level will reduce associated annual energy consumption by 25.4%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 11883, '0000-00-00', 14, 'No one is assigned to do the implementation', 1, 0, 8),
(4638, 11525, 2, 'Improve Influent Pump Efficiency', 331, '2.4131', 1, 21057, 10529, 9404, 'Improve pumping efficiencies of influent pumps 3 and 4 by rebuilding damaged pumps. The efficiency of pump 3 can be improved from 34% to a reasonable average of 80% and the efficiency of pump 4 can be improved from 40% to a reasonable average of 79%. Rebuilding influent pumps 3 and 4 to achieve the proposed efficiencies will reduce associated annual energy consumption by 54%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 10529, 9404, '0000-00-00', 14, 'no one is assigned to do the implementation', 1, 0, 7),
(4639, 11526, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 22000, 0, 5000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4640, 11529, 3, 'Reduce Ammonia Discharge Pressure', 333, '2.2621', 2, 14000, 7000, 5708, 'Reduce the minimum ammonia discharge (condensing) pressure on the refrigeration compressors from 115 (71Â°F) to 93 psig (60Â°F) to decrease refrigeration system energy cost by 5%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 7000, 5708, '0000-00-00', 0, 'They called over Energy Trust of Oregon and got it adjusted', 1, 0, 7),
(4641, 11530, 1, 'Install Fan VFD with O2 Controls', 331, '2.1116', 1, 14245, 7123, 31057, 'Install an oxygen (O2) sensor in the boiler stack and a variable frequency drive (VFD) on the forced draft fan to control fan speed based on oxygen content. This will increase combustion efficiency by optimizing the air-fuel ratio, reducing natural gas consumption by 7.9%. Additionally, it will reduce fan power, resulting in a 63% decrease in fan electrical consumption.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 7123, 31057, '0000-00-00', 16, 'not planning to implement ', 1, 0, 5),
(4642, 11531, 5, 'Install Wastewater Treatment System', 331, '3.4131', 2, 3300000, 3300000, 712265, 'Install a wastewater treatment technology. This will reduce biological oxygen demand (BOD) and total suspended solids (TSS) concentrations in effluent by 80%, decreasing associated annual wastewater service charges by 83.8%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 3300000, 712265, '0000-00-00', 0, 'They are doing the feasibility study', 1, 0, 4),
(4643, 11532, 2, 'Install Dry Running Vacuum Pump', 336, '2.4321', 1, 50000, 50000, 55473, 'Install a dry running vaccum pump in place of the current liquid ring vacuum pump. This will reduce water usage and wastewater discharge, reducing associated vacuum pump costs by 87.8%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 50000, 55473, '0000-00-00', 0, 'Researching', 1, 0, 4),
(4644, 11533, 4, 'Install High Efficiency Water Heater', 339, '2.1392', 2, 75000, 37500, 27166, 'Install a high efficiency water heating system in place of the current gas fired water heating system. This will reduce natural gas use, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 71.4%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 37500, 27166, '0000-00-00', 16, 'Hasn\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\'t been implemented yet', 1, 0, 5),
(4645, 11542, 7, 'Upgrade Air Compressor Controls', 339, '2.4224', 2, 146000, 0, 40819, 'Replace the current 200 hp air compressor with a 250 hp, VFD controlled compressor and implement a VFD trim sequencing strategy to control the load on each compressor. These actions will reduce associated annual energy use by 30%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 40819, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility plans to upgrade compressed air controls and is looking into it now.', 1, 0, 10),
(4646, 11543, 4, 'Reduce Compressed Air Leaks', 339, '2.4236', 2, 15843, 0, 14844, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 970 acfm (95% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 308 acfm (30% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Maintaining this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 8%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 14844, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 8),
