(4648, 11545, 1, 'Induced Boiler Fan VFD', 335, '2.4144', 2, 23913, 0, 29475, 'Install a Variable Frequency Drive (VFD) on the boiler\'s induced draft fan. A VFD will control the airflow by automatically adjusting fan motor speed, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 75%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 29475, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 5),
(4649, 11546, 3, 'Repair Condensate Return System', 321, '2.2121', 2, 56191, 0, 56191, 'Repair the existing condensate return system. This will reduce annual make-up water needed, and associated cost and treatment by 63.3%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 56191, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 3),
(4650, 11547, 5, 'Shut Down HVP Pumps', 336, '4.652', 2, 30226, 0, 23961, 'Install programmable logic controls (PLC) on the four high volume low pressure (HVP) pumps at hot press lines one, two, and three, to shut down when the high pressure pumps are loaded, and motor soft starts to help motors ramp back up to full speed throughout operation. These actions will reduce HVP pumping associated annual energy consumption by 73%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 23961, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Facility is busy upgrading the plant sites and upgrading controls packages and machinery.', 1, 0, 4),
(4651, 11458, 5, 'Use Gas Dryer in Place of Heat Guns', 333, '2.5196', 1, 0, 0, 1764, 'Use the gas fired parts dryer in place of heat guns to dry rinse water off of antiqued parts. Doing so will reduce electrical energy use, fire hazards, and excess heating of workspaces. This will reduce associated annual energy consumption by 100%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1764, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 4),
(4652, 11592, 5, 'Correct Power Factor', 339, '2.3211', 2, 15201, 15201, 3528, 'Install 490 kVAR of capacitance to correct the low power factor and reduce reactive power charges by 87.0%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 15201, 3528, '0000-00-00', 1, 'The facility believes that the payback is too long and do not consider projects with this long of payback time.', 1, 0, 4),
(4653, 11593, 1, 'Install Soot Blower', 330, '2.1231', 2, 62840, 62840, 237276, 'Install a soot blower on Boiler #1 This will continuously remove ash from boiler tubes, increasing boiler efficiency and reducing associated annual energy consumption by 7.8%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 62840, 237276, '0000-00-00', 6, 'The facility has not implemented this yet because it requires downtime. If they have downtime between July and December 2015 they will consider it but they are shooting for next year. They are currently replacing their Boiler #2 with a natural gas boiler and doing other improvements on Boiler #1 to meet requirements.', 1, 0, 3),
(4654, 11594, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 10000, 0, 10000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4655, 11595, 7, 'Reduce Electrical Demand', 315, '2.3131', 1, 10000, 10000, 21180, 'Eliminate times of unnecessarily high electrical demand by operating equipment with high power draw more uniformly or staggering equipment startup. If months with peak demands above a reasonable peak (defined later) are reduced, annual demand savings of 3,000 kWÂ·mo are available. This is a reduction of 2.9% in total electrical demand.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 10000, 21180, '2015-05-20', 0, 'Continuous process. No savings data yet but they are trying to change their scheduling and reduce their demand.', 1, 0, 4),
(4656, 11596, 4, 'Reduce Sprinkler Use', 330, '3.4151', 3, 0, 0, 1003, 'Reduce sprinkler use by turning them off when there is adequate rain. This will reduce associated annual energy consumption by 5.2%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1003, '2015-05-20', 0, 'This has been implemented as there have been trainings to inform personnel that they should be turning off the sprinklers. The winter has been dry so they have been unable to turn them off as much as recommended.', 1, 0, 4),
