(4669, 11609, 1, 'Tune GTS #2 and Install Fan VFD', 336, '2.1116', 1, 12315, 10730, 14677, 'Tune the burner on the GTS thermal oil heater #2 retrofit its fan with a variable frequency drive (VFD) and O2 Controls. This will increase combustion efficiency and decrease excess air, saving $14,676 and reducing associated annual natural gas energy consumption by 1.3%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 10730, 14677, '2017-04-01', 0, 'The facility is installing a new Jet Dryer that will replace one of the convection dryers. The facility is focusing on this project before they work on the GTS heaters. They also need to replace the thermal oil in the GTS heaters before they can tune it. They also are still considering the VFD controls to go along with it. This is in sight and on their minds to implement and estimated Spring 2017 as the time they will get around to it', 1, 0, 7),
