(4673, 11628, 4, 'Insulate Dryer Panels', 334, '2.2511', 2, 7643, 7643, 7377, 'Insulate the metal panels above the dryer doors. This will reduce heat loss from hot surfaces on the dryers, lowering associated annual energy Loss by 91%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 7643, 7377, '2017-04-01', 22, 'The facility is installing a new Jet Dryer that will replace one of the convection dryers. The facility is focusing on this project before they work on the convection dryers. This project will decommission one of the dryers. They will evaluate the insulation after the installation of the Jet Dryer and estimate Spring 2017 as the time they will get around to it.', 1, 0, 4),
