(4677, 11634, 4, 'Process Sander Dust into Solid Fuel', 333, '2.1336', 1, 67550, 67550, 20241, 'Process sander dust and ply trim into pellets or briquettes and add to hog fuel. This will eliminate use of the sander dust blower and 19,908 gallons of purchased propane, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 66%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 67550, 20241, '0000-00-00', 6, 'Jose mentioned that they focused more on the Boiler MACT and were changing more of the boiler controls and did not look into this.', 1, 0, 4),
(4678, 11635, 1, 'Convert Hydraulics to Electric Motors', 341, '2.4324', 1, 242261, 121131, 131605, 'Replace the hydraulic pumps and motors used on the conveyor systems in the facility with electric premium efficiency motors. This will increase conveyor system efficiencies by 51% and reduce associated annual energy consumption by 56%.', 0, 1, 0, 0, 14000000, 131605, '2015-06-25', 0, 'Implemented a new robotic fill line. The conveyer uses primarily electric motors outside of small hydraulic motors on 90 degree turns. The primary reason for implementation was the soft starts on the motors. Said payback was minimal if any.', 1, 0, 4),
