(4782, 12100, 2, 'Tune Boilers', 354, '2.1233', 2, 1000, 1000, 4161, 'Adjust boiler VFD settings to operate with 4% excess oxygen. This will reduce annual natural gas consumption by 2%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1000, 4161, '2015-07-15', 0, 'Tune Boilers; The timing of your audit was such that the actual annual boiler service was 2 weeks after the visit. This is an annual PM that is scheduled.', 1, 0, 8),
