¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¦ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¾ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ containers to add ingredients into the kettles. By the end of FÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¦ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¦ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¾ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢18, we expect this project to be complete', 1, 0, 4),
(4788, 12106, 5, 'Flash Steam Recovery', 341, '2.2127', 2, 19050, 19050, 15571, 'Install a pressure vessel to capture the flash steam from the steam system. This can be used to preheat the make up water that is currently being heated by the boiler, reducing natural gas use by 3.6%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 19050, 15571, '0000-00-00', 11, '   Flash Steam Recovery; This is under consideration as part of a larger hot water upgrade project. There is no immediate time line, but FÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¾Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¦ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Â ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¬ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚Â¦ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¾ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™Ãƒâ€ Ã¢â‚¬â„¢ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ã‚Â¬Ãƒâ€¦Ã‚Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã…Â¡ÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¢18 or beyond is the soonest the requirement will be needed', 1, 0, 4);
INSERT INTO `Recommendations` (`RecommendationId`, `TaskId`, `Number`, `Title`, `EmployeeId`, `ARC`, `APPCodeId`, `TotalCost`, `CapitalCost`, `Savings`, `Summary`, `Rebate`, `Incremental`, `BPT`, `BPToolId`, `ImplementationCost`, `ImplementationSavings`, `ImplementationDate`, `ImplementationCode`, `ImplementationComments`, `Final`, `EarlyPA`, `Pages`) VALUES
(4789, 12107, 4, 'Install AGV Forklifts', 352, '2.8227', 3, 188400, 188400, 175008, 'Install automatically-driven forklifts to transport pallets of finished goods from packaging to shipping. This will reduce production line delays, increasing production by an estimated 2.3%', 0, 0, 0, 0, 188400, 175008, '0000-00-00', 1, 'Install AGV Forklifts; This project does not have a financial justification, so we will not pursue it', 1, 0, 4),
(4790, 12112, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 200000, 0, 420000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0),
(4791, 11865, 2, 'Install High Temperature Fan', 339, '2.1116', 1, 38517, 38517, 122402, 'Install a high temperature fan to circulate air in the three Lindberg shell fire furnaces instead of using the combustion fans and install a VFD with O2 controls on the combustion fan. This will increase combustion efficiency of each furnace by optimizing the air-fuel ratio, and reduce natural gas consumption by 93.5%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 38517, 122402, '0000-00-00', 4, '\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Not consistent with needs of the manufacturing process\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"', 1, 0, 9),
(4792, 12116, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 30000, 0, 2700, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4793, 12117, 3, 'Replace Belts with Notched V-Belts', 353, '2.4322', 1, 0, 0, 2990, 'Replace standard V-Belts with Notched V-Belts on all HVAC motors. This will increase belt efficiency from 93% to 95%, reducing motor energy use by approximately 2%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2964, '0000-00-00', 19, 'The HVAC & Refrigeration Departments tried the V-notch belts but were not happy with the performance.', 1, 0, 4),
(4794, 12118, 4, 'Install Photovoltaic Array', 342, '2.9114', 3, 150000, 51745, 6390, 'Install a photovoltaic array on the roofs of buildings Barrel 5 and Materials Staging Facility. This will provide an alternative energy production source for 0.6% of the facility\'s energy consumption.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 51745, 6390, '0000-00-00', 1, 'Received quotes for two projects after the assessment, but not implemented due to cost and ROI.', 1, 0, 10),
(4795, 12119, 5, 'Install New Condenser Tower', 348, '2.2621', 2, 30000, 15000, 5000, 'Incrementally replace the condenser tower in the north dock system to increase refrigeration capacity, and lower the minimum ISCEON M099 condensing (discharge) pressure on the refrigeration compressors to 100 psig (62.3Â°F). This will reduce the work of compression, saving associated energy costs by 6%.', 0, 1, 0, 0, 15000, 5000, '0000-00-00', 11, 'This project is on our short list for FY17', 1, 0, 8),
(4796, 12120, 2, 'Reduce Cooling Water', 347, '3.4111', 2, 2900, 2900, 2010, 'Install dissolved oxygen level monitors that would control the use of agitators in the two aeration basins.  The monitors would reduce excess agitator use by up to 66% per year.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2900, 2010, '0000-00-00', 1, 'This is not implemented or forecasted due to ROI return at this point', 1, 0, 4),
(4797, 12121, 1, 'Install Alternative Water Heater', 353, '2.1392', 2, 54000, 54000, 7000, 'Install a direct contact water heater in place of the current gas fired bakery boiler. This will increase water heating efficiency from 54% to 99%, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 45%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 54000, 7000, '0000-00-00', 11, 'This has been tentatively forecasted in our FY18 Capital Plan year', 1, 0, 6),
(4798, 12140, 5, 'Install a VFD on Condenser Fan', 332, '2.6231', 1, 2115, 1058, 611, 'Install a variable frequency drive (VFD) on the condenser in the small condenser tower attached to Engine Room B. This will reduce airflow and save associated energy consumption by 34%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 1058, 611, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 6),
(4799, 12141, 4, 'Reduce Refrigeration Discharge Pressure', 348, '2.2621', 2, 0, 0, 1530, 'Lower the minimum ammonia condensing (discharge) pressure on the refrigeration compressors from 125 psig (74.6Â°F) to 105 psig (65.9Â°F). This will reduce the work of compression and will decrease refrigeration system energy use by 5%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 0, 8),
(4800, 12142, 6, 'Install Thermosyphon Oil Cooling', 348, '2.2621', 2, 28000, 15398, 4262, 'Install a thermosyphon oil cooling system on the liquid injection refrigeration compressors. This will eliminate the energy required to recompress additional refrigerant vapor for oil cooling, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 10%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 15398, 4262, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 5),
(4801, 12143, 0, 'Install Air Curtains', 355, '27447', 3, 35000, 0, 3372, 'Install a 16 foot long air curtain with high speed door compatibility on each of the five high speed refrigeration doors to reduce energy loss from refrigerated air escaping and ambient air entering. This will reduce current refrigeration energy use by 2%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 4),
(4802, 12144, 1, 'Repair Condensate Return System', 353, '2.2121', 2, 40792, 40792, 124247, 'Repair the existing condensate return system. This will reduce annual boiler energy consumption by 7% and make-up water consumption by 55%.																													\n																													\n																													', 0, 0, 0, 0, 40792, 124247, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 4),
(4803, 12145, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 2000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4804, 12146, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 5000, 0, 4000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4805, 12147, 7, 'Reduce Compressed Air Pressure', 339, '2.4231', 2, 1000, 1000, 2587, 'Reduce the compressed air system pressure from 124 psig to 110 psig. Maintaining a pressure greater than that required by the system provides little added benefit. Reducing pressure will decrease associated annual energy use by 9%.																													\n																													\n																													', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1000, 2587, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 7),
(4806, 12152, 8, 'Recover Air Compressor Heat', 354, '2.2434', 2, 7816, 7816, 4958, 'Recover waste heat generated by air compression to supplement the heat in the main building of the facility This will reduce annual natural gas consumption by 887 MMBtu per year.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 7816, 4958, '0000-00-00', 5, 'Recover Air Compressor Array; This does not have enough impact to pursue at this time', 1, 0, 3),
(4807, 12188, 6, 'Reduce Compressed Air Pressure', 352, '2.4231', 2, 45000, 22500, 7282, 'Reduce compressed air system pressure from current settings to 110 psig and install a new 6 inch header line for the facility. Maintaining a pressure greater than that required by the system provides little added benefit. Reducing pressure will decrease associated annual energy use by 19%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 45000, 15958, '2017-07-04', 0, 'Will be implemented in 2017.', 1, 0, 13),
(4808, 12189, 5, 'Install Hot Water Tank', 321, '2.2444', 2, 56706, 56706, 11271, 'Install two heat exchangers to recover heat from the whey process after incoming milk is shut down. This recovered energy can be used to preheat the incoming milk the next day, saving a combined 272,241 kWh in boiler and refrigeration energy use.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 56706, 11271, '0000-00-00', 1, 'Will not be implemented. Tank installation cost would be significantly higher than the OSU EEC estimate. This increases the payback period and will not meet capital planning requirements.', 1, 0, 8),
(4809, 12190, 4, 'Install LED Lighting', 354, '2.7142', 3, 55579, 27789, 17591, 'Install LED lighting in the locations indicated on the Lighting Summary sheet. This will increase lighting efficiency and reduce associated annual energy consumption by 73%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 27789, 17591, '2017-07-04', 0, 'Planned for Q1/Q2 2017.', 1, 0, 38),
(4810, 12191, 4, 'Switch Boiler Fuel to Propane', 354, '2.1311', 3, 0, 0, 317386, 'Switch the boiler system fuel mix from electricity/diesel to 100% propane. This will result in immediate payback\nand reduce total boiler fuel costs by 14%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 625250, '0000-00-00', 16, 'Propane prices are currently climbing, so electricity is favored. ', 1, 0, 3),
(4811, 12192, 2, 'Upgrade Reverse Osmosis Unit ', 355, '2.6221', 1, 247000, 61000, 188688, 'Upgrade the Reverse Osmosis (RO) unit with the idle unit located at your sister plant, to make the evaporation\nprocess for whey production more efficient and reduce steam demand on the boiler system. This will reduce current\npropane use by 29%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 61000, 189357, '2019-01-04', 0, 'Involves downstream modifications and will not occur immediately. It is planned to be implemented in 2019.', 1, 0, 3),
(4812, 12193, 1, 'Increase Refrigeration Capacity', 343, '4.652', 1, 1300000, 0, 2308919, 'Install a booster compressor and a high capacity evaporator in the ice cream storage freezer. This will increase\nrefrigeration capacity, and increase annual ice cream production by 4,760,000 lbs.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3225660, '2017-07-04', 0, 'Currently in design for 2017 construction.', 1, 0, 3),
(4813, 12202, 3, 'Increase Insulation Thickness in Boilers', 342, '2.2512', 2, 9160, 4580, 3897, 'Increase insulation thickness on the surfaces of Boilers #2 and #3. This will reduce heat loss from hot surfaces, lowering annual energy consumption by 1% per year.																												\n																													', 1, 0, 0, 0, 4580, 3897, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 8),
(4814, 12158, 1, 'Eliminate Steam Spikes', 332, '2.6242', 2, 9638, 9638, 58326, 'Eliminate steam spikes by installing a pump and piping from a backup tank to a primary tank near the soap end of the process. Using the backup tank to slowly heat water will eliminate steam spikes, and allow the use of only one boiler rather than two. This will reduce associated annual energy consumption by 5.4%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 9638, 58326, '2017-02-01', 0, 'They have tried 5 different projects so far to eliminate steam spikes. That is the reason it is not considered done yet. The next project is seeing about putting an accumulator in, but it is a few months out still due to cost.', 1, 0, 5),
(4815, 12298, 1, 'Reduce Compressed Air Leaks', 348, '2.4236', 2, 50205, 50205, 48205, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 1219 acfm (53% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 684 acfm (30% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Maintaining this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 19%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 50205, 48205, '2017-01-01', 0, '\"The Particleboard facility has a preventative maintenance work request system in place used to identify and notify maintenance of compressed air leaks so they can be scheduled for repair.  In addition, maintenance reviews the compressed air system on a routine basis and the compressors are monitored each shift to identify leaks and other potential problems.  Routine maintenance and repair is performed as needed.  As you know this is an ongoing process.  Cost savings and associated expenses related to system maintenance are not currently available.\"', 1, 0, 8),
(4816, 12300, 3, 'Convert to Electric Forklifts', 347, '2.8227', 1, 694826, 694826, 207496, 'Incrementally purchase electric forklifts instead of propane forklifts when the forklifts need to be replaced. This will decrease propane fuel use, operating costs, and emissions that are potentially hazardous in confined areas. Implementation will reduce associated energy and operating costs by 60.6%. ', 0, 1, 0, 0, 694826, 207496, '0000-00-00', 3, '\"This project may be implemented in the future, but there are no forklift replacements in our capital expenditure plan for 2017.\"', 1, 0, 7),
(4817, 12301, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 20000, 0, 68000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4818, 12304, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 100000, 0, 21000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4819, 12307, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 100000, 0, 20000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4820, 12309, 5, 'Replace Belts with Notched V-Belts', 347, '2.4322', 1, 0, 0, 20781, 'Replace standard V-Belts with Notched V-Belts on all motors in Plywood 1 and 2. This will reduce current motor energy usage by approximately 2%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20781, '0000-00-00', 10, '\" V-Belts may be replaced with notched V-Belts in the future, but this recommendation has not yet been implemented.\"', 1, 0, 5),
(4821, 12310, 1, 'Initiate Incentive Program', 343, '4.421', 4, 60000, 60000, 78500, 'Initiate a group based incentive program to reduce waste by 1% and increase productivity by 1%. This will generate savings of $27,712 annually, costing $60,000, with a payback period of 2.6 years.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 60000, 77000, '0000-00-00', 11, '\" An incentive program is not included in the current Union contract.\"', 1, 0, 3),
(4822, 12311, 1, 'Upgrade Dryer Infeeders', 342, '4.445', 1, 186000, 186000, 539616, 'Upgrade dryer feeders in lines 4 and 5 for an equivalent technology that can handle veneer 4 to 52 inches wide. This will allow the company to reassign 19,272 hours of labor to other tasks, equivalent to $539,616 in labor.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 186000, 539616, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 5),
(4823, 12312, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 60000, 0, 20000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4824, 12313, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 50000, 0, 146000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4825, 12317, 2, 'Install Boiler Fan VFDs', 341, '2.4144', 2, 468122, 0, 680062, 'Install Variable Frequency Drives (VFDs) the forced and induced draft fans of Boilers 2 and 6. A VFD will control airflow by automatically adjusting fan motor speed, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 79%. This will generate savings of $680,062, costing $468,122, with a payback period of 0.7 years.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 427000, 274500, '2016-09-01', 0, '\"Project cost = $853,000\nETO Incentive = $426,000\nFinal Cost to RFP = $427,000\n \nEstimated Savings = 4,500,000 kWhr / year x $0.061/kWH = $274,500/yr\n \nBoiler 1 & 2 Fan VFD installation is planned for 2017. \"', 1, 0, 12),
(4826, 12318, 3, 'Reduce Compressed Air Leaks', 348, '2.4236', 2, 59203, 59203, 54203, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 3,190 acfm (76% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 2,503 acfm (60% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Maintaining this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 11%.This will generate savings of $54,203, costing $59,203, with a payback period of 1.1 years.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 35618, 25618, '2017-01-01', 0, '\"The Plywood facility has a preventative maintenance work request system in place used to identify and notify maintenance of compressed air leaks so they can be scheduled for repair.  In addition, maintenance reviews the compressed air system on a routine basis and the compressors are monitored each shift to identify leaks and other potential problems.  Routine maintenance and repair is performed as needed.  Cost savings and associated expenses related to system maintenance are not currently available.\"', 1, 0, 8),
(4827, 12321, 2, 'Insulate Dryers', 343, '2.2511', 2, 32596, 16298, 24174, 'Insulate the metal dryer drums. This will reduce heat loss from hot surfaces on the dryers, lowering associated annual energy consumption by 91%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 16298, 24174, '0000-00-00', 3, '\"This project may be implemented in the future, but it is not in our current capital expenditure plan for 2017.\"', 1, 0, 7),
(4828, 12325, 0, '', 0, '', 1, 20000, 0, 3500, '', 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
