(4832, 12380, 8, 'Install Notched V-Belt', 352, '2.4111', 2, 0, 0, 1463, 'Replace standard v-belts with notched v-belts. The use of notched v-belts will reduce motor energy use by 2.1% on average through improved transmission efficiency.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1463, '0000-00-00', 22, 'Facility is currently looking into implementation. Personnel says replacing belts incrementally will start soon.', 1, 0, 4),
(4833, 12381, 5, 'Install Boiler Fan VFD with O2 Controls', 353, '2.1116', 1, 5617, 5617, 4259, 'Install an oxygen (O2) sensor in the boiler stack and a variable frequency drive (VFD) on the forced draft fan to control fan speed based on oxygen content. This will increase combustion efficiency by optimizing the air-fuel ratio, reducing natural gas consumption by 5.0%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 5617, 4259, '0000-00-00', 22, 'Facility is currently looking into implementation. Personnel says this will be done in the future.', 1, 1, 6),
(4834, 12382, 3, 'Reduce Conveyor Idle Time', 346, '2.4111', 1, 900, 900, 906, 'Turn off the packaging conveyor lines and operate only when needed to reduce associated annual energy consumption by 10%.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 900, 906, '0000-00-00', 17, 'Facility still interested in implementation. Hard to train personnel to shut off conveyor.', 1, 0, 3),
(4835, 12384, 2, 'Reduce Wastewater BOD Levels', 347, '3.4131', 2, 37239, 37239, 26260, 'Install dissolved oxygen level monitors to control agitator use in the two aeration basins, reducing the cost of sewer bills by up to 50% per year.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2500, 7200, '2016-08-01', 0, 'Tried 3 month Trial with Nalco that did not go well. They are currently using Bugs.', 1, 0, 4),
(4836, 12386, 6, 'Install VFD on Low Pressure Blowers', 352, '2.4141', 1, 8396, 3410, 6165, 'Install a variable frequency drive (VFD) on the low pressure air blowers used to produce low pressure air for cleaning, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 72.5%.\n\n', 1, 0, 0, 0, 3410, 6165, '0000-00-00', 18, 'Spencer Blower (Manufacturer) says installing a VFD on facility\\\'s current blowers is not possible.', 1, 1, 11),
(4837, 12387, 4, 'Install Level Controls on Oil Tank', 352, '2.2511', 2, 1700, 1700, 6192, 'Install a level control system on the oil holding tank to reduce annual material loss and associated costs by 7% per year.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1700, 6192, '0000-00-00', 22, 'Facility is currently looking into implementation. Personnel says this will be done in the future.', 1, 0, 3),
(4838, 12388, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 15000, 0, 3000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0),
(4839, 12389, 1, 'Reduce Product Giveaway', 353, '3.1191', 1, 400000, 400000, 135000, 'Reduce product giveaway by upgrading the product weight batching process. This will reduce product giveaway by 0.5%, and associated financial costs by $135,000 per year.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 250000, 150000, '2016-08-30', 0, 'I believe this is the most important one for more than one reason. I am currently working with local software engineers in designing a new program and retrofitting the machine. I believe the payback is a lot quicker than three years if we incorporate more automation and eliminate bodies. I will also look at the work sheet and run it by our controller for fact checks.  In fact I have budgeted capital dollars to use in 2016 once a plan is approved.', 1, 0, 4),
(4840, 12390, 2, 'Install Efficient Lighting', 353, '2.7135', 3, 6332, 6332, 3440, 'Install T8 Florescent lights in the value added (VA) warehouses with occupancy sensors and install occupancy sensors in the Fish House 1 Storage room. This will increase lighting efficiency in the VA warehouse and reduce operation hours in both the VA warehouse and Fish House 1, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 8%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 8500, 3000, '2016-12-04', 0, 'this is a good study and lighting efficiency is pretty straight forward. This can be implemented during our slow down at the end of the summer. Very interesting information on the Technology Background information.', 1, 0, 14),
(4841, 12391, 3, 'Reduce Air Pressure in VA', 353, '5.4231', 1, 500, 500, 1283, 'Reduce compressed air pressure from the main compressor in the Value Added (VA) facility. This will reduce the load on the compressor, and lower annual energy consumption and associated cost by 12.5%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1500, 1283, '2016-11-10', 0, 'this one always comes up on every energy audit ive ever been involved in. What normally dictates the plants operating pressure is the piece of equipment that needs a critical pressure to keep it operating correctly. Our sealing machines (Multivacs) use large volumes of air during to run a lifting mechanism during a cycle process which cannot drop below 90 psi due to a pressure transducer communicating to a PLC. I believe we would have to install dedicated  one half piping from the receiver to each machine in order to achieve the 90 psi recommendation. I believe the cost is going to be over $500 and will require the downtime opportunity to complete this task.', 1, 0, 2),
(4842, 12392, 4, 'Install Photovoltaic Array', 339, '2.9114', 3, 144540, 54525, 8201, 'Install a photovoltaic array on the roofs of buildings Barrel 5 and Materials Staging Facility. This will provide an alternative energy production source for 14.7% of the facility\'s energy consumption.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 54525, 8201, '0000-00-00', 1, ' with a payback of 6.6 years, I dont see an opportunity to submit a project like this at this time. In thinking outside the box, I am wondering if it would be feasible to replace office lighting with LEDs and power them with solar panels.  The project would be smaller, more cost effective and make us be green', 1, 0, 9),
(4843, 12395, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 2000, 0, 800, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0),
(4844, 12396, 5, 'Install High Speed Doors', 347, '2.7447', 3, 12000, 3600, 10575, 'Replace freezer doors with high speed roll-up doors controlled with motion sensors to reduce energy loss from refrigerated air escaping through open doors. This will reduce current refrigeration energy use by 59%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 3600, 10575, '0000-00-00', 20, 'Haven\'t looked into this yet', 1, 0, 5),
(4845, 12398, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 3000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, 0),
(4846, 12401, 1, 'Replace Air Knifes with Electric Knifes', 352, '2.4324', 2, 54089, 18807, 52251, 'Replace currently used air powered knives with electric knives. This will reduce annual electricity costs associated with manually cutting fish by 39% per year.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 18807, 52251, '2017-01-01', 0, '\"All air knives have been replaced. We have increased our production times to two shifts and we are running 16 hours a day. I have not done any tracking but I have a request in to our office manager to get some electrical billing data. \"', 1, 0, 4),
(4847, 12402, 2, 'Consolidate Refrigeration System', 0, '2.2622', 2, 375000, 205256, 76637, 'Consolidate the sixteen Freon based refrigeration systems into a single, efficient ammonia based refrigeration system. This will result in a higher coefficient of performance (COP) and allow for heat recovery from the centralized system. This measure will reduce refrigeration energy costs by an estimated  46%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 205256, 76637, '0000-00-00', 2, '\"We haven’t implemented this due to up front Capital costs being too high. The evaporators alone would be $350,000.00 by the time we put in the compressor package we would be in the million dollar range. Our bills run around 10,000 dollars a month. It would be three years for ROI on just the evaporators. It’s hard to get capital for that kind of project.\"', 1, 0, 6),
(4848, 12403, 5, 'Reduce Compressed Air Pressure ', 0, '2.4231', 1, 7800, 2340, 1783, 'Reduce the compressed air system pressure from 125 psig to 100 psig on the Quincy air compressor. This will reduce the load on the compressor, and lower annual energy consumption and associated cost by 12.5%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 2340, 1783, '0000-00-00', 20, '\"Haven’t done this yet. We originally designed the air system to have a 2000 gallon tank for air storage. We would run the plant to 95 and pump the air tank to 120 psi. Over time this practice was not followed.\"', 1, 0, 3),
(4849, 12404, 0, '', 0, '', 0, 1000, 0, 1000, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(4850, 12186, 2, 'Flash Steam Recovery', 353, '2.2127', 2, 30728, 30728, 36536, 'Install a pressure vessel to capture the flash steam from the boiler. This will preheat the water that is currently being heated by the boiler, reducing natural gas consumption by 5%.																													\n																									', 0, 0, 0, 0, 30728, 36536, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 4),
(4851, 12425, 6, 'Reduce Saw Test Operation Time', 315, '2.6212', 1, 302, 302, 1080, 'Manually test saw blade alignment after blade changes on the band mill to reduce associated annual energy consumption by 100%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 302, 1080, '0000-00-00', 14, '', 1, 0, 7),
(4852, 12427, 5, 'Reduce Compressed Air Leaks', 315, '2.4236', 2, 6683, 6683, 5683, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 373 acfm (51% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 221 acfm (30% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Maintaining this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 19%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 6683, 5683, '2016-06-01', 0, 'The facility is aggressively going after air leaks with an ultrasonic flow meter. ', 1, 0, 7),
(4853, 12430, 3, 'Install Notched V-Belts', 348, '2.4111', 2, 0, 0, 7567, 'Upgrade all belt driven motors to notched V-belts as standard V-belts need replacement. The use of notched V-belts will reduce motor energy use by approximately 2% through improved transmission efficiency. ', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 7567, '0000-00-00', 14, '', 1, 0, 4),
(4854, 12432, 7, 'Install LED Lighting', 343, '2.7142', 3, 70568, 67152, 15058, 'Install LED lighting throughout the facility. This will increase lighting efficiency, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 1%.\n', 1, 0, 0, 0, 67152, 15058, '0000-00-00', 14, '', 1, 0, 42),
(4855, 12434, 4, 'Increase Baghouse Efficiency', 341, '2.5121', 2, 864, 864, 2998, 'Increase the dust collection system\'s (DCS) baghouse efficiency to reduce associated annual energy consumption by 5.0% and maintenance costs by 47.5%.', 0, 1, 0, 0, 864, 2998, '0000-00-00', 14, '', 1, 0, 8),
(4856, 12437, 2, 'Control Hydraulic Tank Heaters', 355, '4.652', 1, 2500, 2500, 15820, 'Install automatic controls on all hydraulic tank heaters in the facility to reduce unnecessary wear to system components, minimize improper operation, and prevent additional stoppages due to insufficient warm-up, increasing associated annual production by 0.1%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2500, 15820, '0000-00-00', 14, '', 1, 0, 3),
(4857, 12438, 1, 'Convert Stacker Hydraulics ', 355, '4.1120', 1, 130000, 102204, 41305, 'Convert the hydraulic system controlling the stacker mechanism to an electric linear actuator. This will prevent the safety hazard created by hydraulic fluid leaking, and reduce the annual associated maintenance cost, and annual energy consumption of the stacker mechanism by 60%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 102204, 41305, '0000-00-00', 11, 'Have not implemented it but are still pushing it. The project has not received approval yet.', 1, 0, 4),
(4859, 12160, 0, 'Install Economizer in Boiler', 342, '', 2, 7748, 7748, 19803, 'Install an economizer to recover heat from the stack exhaust gases in boilers 1 and 2. This recovered energy can be used to preheat the incoming makeup water, which will save 1.8% of boiler fuel usage.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 7748, 19803, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 0, 0, 7),
(4860, 12159, 3, 'Connect CB RTO Gases to Boiler #2', 342, '3.5312', 2, 132280, 132280, 93635, 'Use flue gases from CB RTO as a heat source for Boiler #2. This will reduce associated annual energy consumption by 8%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 132280, 88017, '0000-00-00', 1, 'This is not going to get done. The distance is too far and it just doesn\\\'t pencil out for a quick turn around.', 1, 0, 5),
(4861, 12161, 5, 'Reduce Heat to the Oil Jackets', 347, '2.2211', 1, 0, 0, 10766, 'Install dissolved oxygen level monitors that would control the use of agitators in the two aeration basins.  The monitors would reduce excess agitator use by up to 66% per year.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10766, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 4),
(4862, 12157, 2, 'Install VFDs on Oven Draft Fans', 0, '2.4143', 1, 210050, 105025, 165797, 'Fix the inlet dampers wide open and install variable frequency drives (VFDs) on the oven draft fans in CA Process and CB Process Zones 4A, 8, 9, and 10. This will decrease the workload on the fans and reduce associated energy consumption by 71%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 210050, 165797, '2017-01-01', 0, 'They were in the middle of writing up the documentation for this AR. They said it looked very promising and will be done in the near  future. ', 1, 0, 7),
(4863, 12460, 2, 'Insulate Kiln Doors', 343, '2.2511', 2, 13082, 6541, 11122, 'Insulate kiln doors with fiber board insulation to reduce heat loss from door and door seals, lowering annual energy consumption by 34% per year.\n', 1, 0, 0, 0, 6541, 11122, '0000-00-00', 14, '', 1, 0, 16),
