(4979, 12930, 6, 'Install Receiver to Reduce Air Pressure', 355, '2.4231', 1, 1888, 944, 1207, 'Install a secondary air receiver for the sandblasting process to reduce the compressed air system pressure to 90 psig. This will reduce the compressed air load reducing annual energy consumption and associated cost by 13.9%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 944, 1207, '0000-00-00', 14, 'Not looked into currently.', 1, 0, 16),
