(5008, 12864, 2, 'Reduce Compressed Air Leaks', 359, '2.4236', 2, 23810, 23810, 22809, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 275 acfm (72% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 114 acfm (30% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Maintaining this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 48%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 23810, 22809, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 9),
