(5010, 12877, 2, 'Centralize Pellet Storage', 356, '2.2412', 2, 10390, 10390, 102571, 'Install an automated centralized storage for polyethylene terepthalate (PET) pellets and install a heat exchanger to recover heat from the high pressure air compressor. This recovered energy can be used to preheat the centralized PET pellet storage, which will reduce air handling unit energy consumption by 39.9% and increase associated productivity by 100%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 10390, 102571, '0000-00-00', 20, 'Due to the PET market  we receive the resin in bulk super sacks from Asia. If re were to receive it in a rail car format this may be justifiable. The buying of all resins is not something we control at the location level. It is all done at the Corporate level.', 1, 0, 10),
(5011, 12955, 1, 'Control Fans using CO2 Sensors', 361, '2.1116', 1, 2948, 2948, 3371, 'Install carbon dioxide (CO2) sensors on the exhaust fans to control the levels of CO2 in the facility by modulating the fan speed. This will reduce the associated energy consumption by 57.7%', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2948, 3371, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 9),
