(5056, 13358, 0, '', 367, '', 1, 0, 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(5057, 13364, 2, 'Improve lighting efficiency', 365, '2.1133', 1, 4001, 2000, 0, 'Turn off redundant lighting and install photocells on light fixtures near skylights. This will reduce associated annual energy consumption by 52%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2000, 0, '0000-00-00', 11, 'We are gathering quotes right now and interacting with an agency to see what incentives we can get.  I would expect that this has a chance to make the FY19 capital ', 1, 0, 14),
(5058, 13365, 1, 'Tune the large pot heater', 368, '2.1133', 1, 500, 500, 0, 'Tune the burner on the large lead melting pot to improve overall combustion efficiency. This will reduce associated energy costs by 12%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 500, 0, '0000-00-00', 22, 'We have not implemented, yet, as it has not been made a priority.  We consider it a worthwhile suggestion.  It was done by other plants in the past.  We did add a thermocouple to the exhaust gasses and are using it to modulate the gas valve.', 1, 0, 6),
(5059, 13360, 5, 'Convert pneumatic motors to electric', 353, '2.4324', 2, 32247, 16124, 0, 'Replace the 19 pneumatic vibrators with electric vibrators. Doing so will reduce annual electrical consumption by 77%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 16124, 0, '0000-00-00', 18, 'We have not implemented.  We converted from electric to pneumatic because of reliability reasons.  We may re-look at this in the future.\n\n ', 1, 0, 6),
(5060, 13363, 4, 'Reduce Cast Strip Trim', 360, '688', 1, 5650, 5650, 3177, 'Reduce the scrap material from the cast strip and expanded metal processes. This will reduce the quantity required to be recycled (re-melted) by 68.8% and reduce the associated annual energy consumption by 6.3%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 5650, 3177, '0000-00-00', 5, 'We have not implemented.  We did this one time in 2008.  We have not tried to reduce further due to concerns about run ability at the expander and how we would continue our quality measures in stripcast.', 1, 0, 7),
(5061, 13361, 0, 'Chiller Overhaul', 364, '2.62187', 1, 340000, 340000, 205629, 'Replace the current 140-ton chiller with a new 180-ton chiller to increase refrigeration capacity. Use increased chiller capacity to cool the rectifier room to 80°F, reducing the frequency of rectifier failure by 20%, and associated energy consumption by 4%.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 340000, 205629, '0000-00-00', 11, 'This is on our FY18 capital plan, but money is on hold.  We are designing and preparing quotes.  I would expect that this has a chance to make the FY19 capital list, including the ', 1, 1, 13),
(5062, 13438, 1, 'Install Lighting Timers', 365, '2.7132', 3, 429, 429, 1526, 'Install lighting timers in the finishing and stock areas. This will reduce operation hours, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 11%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 429, 1526, '0000-00-00', 14, '\"Lighting was not implemented, during that time a key facility equipment broke down that required all personnel focus.  This is however a project that we will want to come back to.  It is a simple change that can lead to good savings.\" -Kyle Pyke', 1, 0, 11),
(5063, 13436, 3, 'Reduce Compressed Air Leaks', 362, '2.4236', 2, 9285, 2321, 8285, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 60 acfm (43% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 24 acfm (30% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Reducing this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 59%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 2321, 8285, '2018-01-01', 0, '\"This is an ongoing project to correct any leaks while going through our preventative maintenance procedures.  It is a cost savings opportunity that has been emphasized while maintaining our equipment.\" -Kyle Pyke', 1, 0, 8),
(5064, 13435, 2, 'Upgrade Rolling Tables', 361, '	2.7231', 1, 1874, 1874, 1989, 'Replace the rolling table lamps with heating blankets and insulation, and use an insulated cover when it is not operating. This will reduce associated energy consumption by 30%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1874, 1989, '0000-00-00', 6, '\"This is in the works but hasn\'t been implemented.  We were originally going to replace the whole machine due to compounding issues.  Through the quoting process and finding the key points of risk, it was instead decided to redesign the machine in house.  To date, we are in the design process for multiple subassemblies of the rolling table.\" -Kyle Pyke', 1, 0, 5),
(5065, 13469, 2, 'Tune Hot Oil Heaters', 361, '2.1233', 2, 1200, 0, 5762, 'Tune hot oil heaters so that a higher average efficiency is maintained throughout the year. This will reduce total associated energy consumption by 15%.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5762, '2018-10-10', 0, '', 1, 0, 6),
(5066, 13443, 1, 'Increase Chiller Efficiency', 365, '4.652', 1, 39442, 0, 220769, 'Replace the oldest scroll chiller with a larger 40-ton chiller. This will increase cooling efficiency, decrease downtime, and increase production by 3.1% annually.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 220769, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 1, 5),
(5067, 13471, 3, 'Upgrade Lighting', 366, '2.7142', 3, 4048, 2024, 772, 'Install light emitting diode (LED) lamps in the facility production area. This will increase lighting efficiency, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 46%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 2024, 772, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 1, 8),
(5068, 13449, 1, 'Recover Air Compressor Heat', 367, '2.2437', 1, 1167, 448, 3431, 'Recover waste heat generated by three air compressors to supplement the heat in the general production floor. This will reduce annual natural gas consumption by 506 MMBtu per year.																													\n																													\n', 1, 0, 0, 0, 448, 3431, '2019-06-15', 0, 'Planning to implement in 2019.', 1, 1, 6),
(5069, 13450, 2, 'Replace RTUs', 364, '2.7232', 1, 18540, 5562, 9221, 'Replace the combined gas and electric rooftops units (RTUs) that service the office space with new models. This will reduce associated natural gas costs by 30% and associated electricity costs by 44%.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 180000, 9221, '2018-10-15', 0, 'In the process of implementing.', 1, 1, 8),
(5070, 13445, 3, 'Install VFDs on trim Fans', 0, '', 1, 2640, 2640, 3049, 'Install variable frequency drives (VFDs) on two 10 hp trim fans. This will reduce associated fan electrical consumption by 46.9%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2640, 3049, '0000-00-00', 22, 'Not implemented, but did inspire spinoff when installing a new fan.', 1, 0, 11),
(5071, 13448, 4, 'Reduce Compressed Air Leaks', 0, '2.4236', 1, 22164, 22164, 21164, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained airflow, from 25 acfm (69% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 11 acfm (30% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Maintaining this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 70%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 22164, 21164, '0000-00-00', 15, '', 1, 0, 0),
(5072, 13465, 5, '', 0, '2.8227', 1, 0, 0, 0, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0),
(5073, 13529, 0, 'Reduce Air Leaks', 366, '2.4236', 1, 1955, 1955, 955, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 45 acfm (33% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 9 acfm (10% of peak, non-leak plant demand). Reducing this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 32%, or $955 annually.																													\n																													\n																													\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 1955, 955, '2018-10-10', 0, '', 1, 1, 8),
(5074, 13525, 2, 'Replace RTUs', 366, '2.1113', 3, 2560, 0, 2926, 'Replace the server room cooling unit and install a hot-cold cooling aisle in the room to reduce probability of server failure and associated electricity costs by 27%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2926, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 7),
(5075, 13526, 1, 'Install Engineered Air Nozzles', 367, '2.4236', 2, 7395, 0, 26801, 'Install engineered air nozzles on all blowdown wands. This will decrease compressed air use, reducing associated annual energy consumption by 79%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 26801, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 6),
(5076, 13522, 3, 'Upgrade Exterior Lighting', 365, '2.7142', 3, 3670, 0, 1898, 'Replace current outdoor lighting with LEDs. This will increase lighting efficiency, reducing annual lighting energy consumption by 4%.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1898, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 15),
(5077, 13609, 0, 'Increase Lighting Efficiency', 362, '2.7142', 3, 10116, 5904, 1446, 'Retrofit existing T5 fluorescent lamps with LEDs. This will increase lighting efficiency, reducing total annual lighting energy consumption by 41%, or $1,445 annually.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 5904, 1446, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 8),
(5078, 13517, 1, 'Recover Compressor Waste Heat', 363, '2.2134', 1, 2800, 2800, 5164, 'Recover waste heat generated by the 350 hp main compressor to supplement heat in the paint booth room during colder months. This will reduce energy consumed by the space heater in the paint booth room by 111,224 kWh, or $5,164 annually .', 0, 0, 0, 0, 2800, 5164, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 5),
(5079, 13515, 1, 'title', 367, '2.4231', 1, 500, 500, 4809, 'Reduce compressed air pressure in Building 33, from 111 psig, and T2, from 140 psig, to 100 psig when sand blasting is not taking place. This will reduce the compressor load, and associated energy consumption by 18%, or $4,809 annually.', 0, 1, 0, 0, 500, 4809, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 7),
(5080, 13456, 0, 'Install Localized Welding Ventilation', 364, '', 1, 12558, 6279, 3942, 'Contain space heating by installing local ventilation ducting for each welding station. This will reduce the amount of heat lost to the outside air by 741 MMBtu and decrease energy costs by 25%, or $3,942 annually.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 6279, 3942, '0000-00-00', 17, '', 1, 0, 0),
(5081, 13516, 3, 'Reduce Air Leaks', 362, '', 2, 28216, 28216, 27216, 'Reduce the compressed air system leak load, or minimum sustained air flow, from 825 acfm (70% of peak, non-leak plant demand) to 107 acfm (30% of peak, non-leak plant demand) at building T2. Maintaining this leak load will decrease associated annual energy use by 54%.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 28216, 27216, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 8),
(5082, 13518, 4, 'Replace Electric Heat with Gas', 364, '2.1311', 2, 148180, 148180, 45260, 'Replace the electric resistance heater used in the custom-built paint booth with a natural gas heater. This will reduce associated energy costs by 62%.\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 148180, 45260, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 1, 6),
(5083, 13622, 0, 'Install seasonal Heat Exchanger', 364, '', 1, 30600, 30600, 13796, '', 1, 0, 0, 0, 30600, 13796, '0000-00-00', 0, '', 1, 0, 0),
