(9274, 663, 2, 1, NULL, 3961, 'Ref. Reduce Discharge Pressure', 0, '<p>The east tower&nbsp;pulls 13.75 amps and is controlled by a pressure switch on/off. Baltimore Aircon of California, Model # VXC-100, Serial # 915419</p>\n<p>The west tower pulls 9.26 amps low speed, 22.78 amps high speed and is controlled by pressure switches low/high/off. Evapco, Model # PWCA155, Serial # 915419&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Both towers are on preventative maintenance schedules and treated regularly keeping them in good shape.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.baltimoreaircoil.eu/products/VXC-14-135\">http://www.baltimoreaircoil.eu/products/VXC-14-135</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 0),
