(65223, 11799, 347, '2015-01-27', 2, 'I looked into the different kinds of pumps and how pump efficiency is calculated. I also looked into finding out the process that IP uses to make paper so I could get an idea of the amount/sizes of the pumps they would use for their industry.', 0),
