(66939, 11989, 348, '2015-06-22', 3, 'Started the compiling process. Send all the analysts an email stating that all the files have been moved to the J drive. Downloaded all the files from Dropbox and moved them into the J drive. Followed the guideline provided throught the EEC operational website on how to compile the report. I was able to get all these done. \n1. organized a folder for each recommendation\n2. Sorted the assessment recommendations in order of payback period\n3. Saved the files into PDF using the convention provided. (completed most of section 3 )', 0),
