(66943, 11989, 348, '2015-06-23', 7, 'Continued the compilation milestone by following the 3-Compile Report instructions on the EEC Operational website. \n1. Organized all the OMC\'s and saved them as PDF files\n2. Filled out the lead financial analysis and send it out for black review \n3. Completed the site data sections which included reviewing the general background,utility analysis, lead site report, and site reports. After I saved all these files into PDF\'s\n4. Read through the sectors best practice section to see which were relevant to the report and saved them as PDF files. \n5. Read through the appendices to see which were relevant to the report and saved them as PDF files. \n6. Filed out all relevant information on the report template and also formatted each section. ', 0);
