(69230, 10999, 348, '2015-09-30', 4, 'Contacted various facilities to try to schedule an audit. Contacted Three River Wastewater Treatment, Georgia-Pacific Resin(Eugene and Albany), RB Rubber, and Treetop(Woodburn) \n\nThree Rivers Wastewater: I contacted the only contact we have on list. He seemed interest, so I sent him the necessary documents \n\nGeorgia-Pacific Resin (Eugene): I talked to Mike Higgins and he said that there was an energy audit done 6-7 months ago but he plans on having another one in a year or two. I sent him the pre-assessment package.\n\nGerogia-Pacifc Resin (Albany): I talked to stephanie cross. I explained to her the service that we provide and she will find someone that we can talk to about the energy audit. \n\nRB Rubber: I was able to get a name of a person we should contact. During the phone call, the person was in a meeting so I was not able to contact him. I plan to contact him in the next few hours. \n\nTreetop Woodburn: I tried calling the facility directly but the only options were to go through corporate to reach someone. I know you have had difficulties with this. \n', 0),
